<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Magito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Magito gya Vanjagila</para>
  <para style="toc2">Magito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Magi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Magito gya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Vanjagila</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongochi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Magito gya Vanjagila kihumulila njowo cha vanu vevamdike Kilisito, pevavangile na kulutala kuhuma ku Yelusalemu mbaka ku Yudeya na Samaliya na inyi chingi cholofu, ngita fila Yesu peavalongie vachulila vake peyave kwelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi Magito 1.8. Kiganulo iki kisimbilwe na Luka yeasimbile Njowo Nofu ngita isimbilwe na Luka. Luka akali mlami na akali isimbila unofu hilo ngita njowo chechihumila. Figanilo fyake fyonda chivili akamsimbilie Mugiliki yumwi yeikemelwa Tewofili, ila fila fila akavasimbilie Vakilisito vonda va Kigiliki na Vayawudi Magito 1.1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Magito gya Vanjagila kihochilwa kisimbilwe pagati umwaka va sitini mbaka sitini na chitai kuhuma peababilwe Yesu Kilisito, kwakuva mwiso va kiganulo kusimbilwa ukali Paulo peyave kudinduliwa kuhuma mu kihopo. Luka akagendele pamwi na mnjagila Paulo, ihochwa akasimbile kiganulo iki akiva ku mwani va Atiokiya. Kiganulo kya Magito gya Vanjagila ndi mwendeleso va Njowo Nofu yeisimbilwe na Luka na kinavanga kulongela chipindi Yesu ihelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Lengo lya Luka lyeligehe mu kiganulo liwana na lila lyeasimbile mu Njowo Nofu. Akang'ang'ile Tewofili pamwi na Vakilisito yevahongelike kumdikila Yesu, ngita pealongile mwene, akasimbile kwa unofu kila kinu kyeagitile Yesu mu uwumi vake na kulutala kwa Ukilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo kya Magito gya Vanjagila kitulongela tuveche ngita Vakilisito va pamwandi pevakali na kwikala kwa kumdikila Yesu. Mifanu gya vanjagila gituwonisa wuliwuli twing'ang'wa kumlumba Muhe va Nguluvi, petulanducha unanzi va Njowo Nofu kwa vanu vangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Muhe va Nguluvi ekuvaachila vachulila na vanu vevamdikie Kilisito vahongelika 1.1—8.1</para>
  <para style="io">Vanu vevamdikie Kilisito vigudwa na kulutala kwivala lya ku Yelusalemu 8.2—12.23</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ivanga lugendo lwake lya kudalika Njowo Nofu 12.24—14.28</para>
  <para style="io">Ludamo litang'ana ukoya ku Yelusalemu kulamula kya kuvagita vanu vevamdikie Yesu vagenji 15.1-35</para>
  <para style="io">Lugendo lwa upili lya Paulo kudalika Njowo Nofu 15.36—18.22</para>
  <para style="io">Lugendo lwa udatu lwa Paulo kudalika Njowo Nofu 18.23—20.38</para>
  <para style="io">Kubatwa kwa Paulo ukoya ku Yelusalemu 21-26</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo isindikwa ukoya Loma 27-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Kwa veve mkomi Teofili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mukiganilo kyendikavangile kusimba ndikasimbile makani gyonda gyeagitile Yesu na kuwulanicha kuhuma pamwandi lya kasi lyake, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka kigono kila peanyamuliwe kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Pehave kunyamuliwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akavagavile malagilicho kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi vala vanjagila yeavahaguwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Mufigono alobaini kuhuma kufuwa kwa mwene avahumiye kwa namuna cholofu chechimchelise kuva akali wumi. Yevamuwonile, vaywangile na mwene njowo cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Kigono kimwi peali iliya pamwi navo akavalongela ndeni, “Mbihile kuhega ku Yelusalemu, mbaka pemuwanuka gala gyeavalongie Daada, pemunipulike ndilonga njowo chake. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohani avabatisile kwa malenga, ila mufigono fidodo fyefikwacha nyenye mwibatiswa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu inyamulwa kuhelela Kuluhano kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliko 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24.50-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Vanjagila pevatang'anile pamwi na Yesu, vakamuhuchile “Wuli Mtwa, figono ifi ukuvawuyisila Vaisilaeli Ung'achale?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu akavahigile, “Figono na majila gya njowo ago gagehe muumwumike va Daada vangu na nyenye semdikilwa kuchela gihumila pandili. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ila Muhe va Nguluvi peakuvakwikila nyenye, mukwanuka ludali na mwivecha mwilonga njowo changu mu mwani lya ku Yelusalemu na inyi cha Yudeya na Samalia na ku inyi chonda.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Peamalile kulonga ago, akanyamuliwe kuhelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kuno vonda vikumlola, baho lifunde likamfihile navo sevamwene kangi.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Pevakali vafulutule meho kuluhano, Yesu peagehe ihelela, bahobaho vanu vavili vafwalile myenda mivalafu pe vimile pepi navo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />vakalongie, “Nyenye vanu va ku Galilaya, wuli mwimile baha kuno mwilolela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi? Yesu uyu yeanyamuliwe palutalo lyenu kuhelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, iwuya kangi ngita pemuwonile ihelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiya ahaguliwe kuhala fwasi lya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matayo 27.3-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Baho vanjagila vakawuyile ku Yelusalemu kuhuma pakidunda weukemelwa kidunda kya Miseituni, weugehe utali va kilomita yimwi kuhuma kumwani va Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Pevafikile kumwani va Yelusalemu vakaingile mulilingo pevakali vikwikala, vakali Peteli na Yohani na Yakobo na Andelea na Filipo na Tomasi na Batolomeo na Matayo na Yakobo mwana va Alifayo na Simoni yeikemelwa Selote, yeacheliwe mtovanila inyi lya Isilaeli na Yuda mwana va Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Avo vonda vaendelie kutang'ana pamwi kumsuka Nguluvi, pamwi na vadala vamonga na Maliya maye vake Yesu na vakolo vake Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Kigono kimwi mufigono ifyo. Peteli akahimile mugati lya vala vaidikila miya na isilini. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Peteli akavalongie, “Lukolo vangu, ndelasima Masimbo Mang'alili gatimile, ambagyo Muhe va Nguluvi akalongile kuchumbila Dawudi, akalagula njowo cha Yuda yeavalongoche vala vanu kumbata Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda akali yumwinga vetu, kwakuva akahaguliwe Yesu agite kasi iyi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Mwene akagulile mgunda kwa chila sendi cheapatile kuhuma mulukani lwake lihofu, peagehe koya kumgunda akaguwe ufuma puu! Lileme likabachuke na mitima gyake gikahumile. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Vanu vonda mu Yelusalemu pevapulike makani ago, ifyo vakaukemela wula mgunda, “Akelidama.” Mana lyake, “Mgunda va Danda.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Peteli alongie “Ngita peisimbilwe mukiganulo kya Sabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Kukaye lyake isigale mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">kwihela munu yeikala mugati lyake.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kangi isimbilwe mukiganulo kya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Munu yungi ahale fwasi lyake lya kugita kasi.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Nonde tumuhagule munu yungi mugati mwa vala vevakali pamwinga na nefwe chipindi chonda cha Mtwa Yesu peakali pamwinga na nefwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Uyu aveche yumwi va vala yevalongochine na nefwe kuhuma Yohani peakali ibatisa mbaka kigono kila Yesu peanyamuliwe kuhuma kwa nefwe kuhelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Uyu itakilwa aveche pamwinga na nefwe kulanducha kuchulubuka kwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Baho vakahaguwe matawa gya vanu vavili, yumwi Yusufu yeakemeliwe Balisaba awu Yusito na yungi ndi Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Baho vakamsuka Nguluvi, “Mtwa, veve wichela mahocho gya kila munu. ndeni ndi ani yehukumuhagula mugati lya ava vavili, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />neke ategule fwasi lya unjagila yealekile Yuda yeahele pono peing'ang'wa aveche.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Vakatovile gudugudu, gudugudu ikampatile Matiya na akaongechwa kwa vala vanjagila vangi kumi na yumwi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwacha kwa Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Kigono kya lihungu lya Pendekositi pekifikile, vanu vonda vevamwidikie Yesu vakatang'anile pamwinga. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Bahobaho, lichwi yapulikike kuhuma kuluhano, likali ngita lukala lyelipuga hilo, ikaimemiche yila kaye yonda yevakali vakalile. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Baho vikahumile finu fyawonike ngita miyale gya lyoto, figawanyike na kutula kwa vanu vonda yevakali mula. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Vonda vamemichwe Muhe va Nguluvi vakavangile kulonga kwa luga yingi ngita Muhe va Nguluvi peuvatangile kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ukoya ku Yelusalemu kukali na Vayawudi, vanu yevamfunyile na kumnjuma Nguluvi, yevahumile kila inyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pevapulike lichwi ilyo, lipinga likomi lya vanu litang'anile pamwi. Vonda vakadudwive hilo, kwakuva kila munu avapulike vadikila vakilonga kwa luga chawo chakubabwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Vakadudwive hilo vakalonga, “Wuli, vonda vetukuvapulika vilonga ndena, sevanu va ku Galilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ivecha wuli, kila yumwi vetu akuvapulika vakilonga kwa luga chawo cha kubabwa? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Vamonga vetu vihuma, ku Palisi na ku Amedi na ku Elamu na vangi ni venyekaye Mesopotamia na ku Yudeya na ku Kapodokia na ku Ponito na ku Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Fulugia na Pamfulia na Misili na pono cha Libiya pepi na Kulene. Vangi mugati lyetu vagenji va kuhuma Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Vayawudi na vanu yevaingie mudini lya Vayawudi na vamonga vahumila ku Kelete na ku Alabia. Nefwe vonda tukuvapulika vakilonga makani makomi gya Nguluvi kwa luga chetu cha kubabwa!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Vonda vakadudwive na kulunguvala kuno vakwiwucha, “Iyi ivecha na mana liki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ila vangi vakavabeda vala vadikila, vakilonga, “Ava vanu vagalile difwayi miya!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli akuvadalikila vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Baho Peteli akahimile pamwinga na vala vanjagila kumi na yumwi na akavanga kuvadalikila vanu kwa lichwi likomi akalonga, vakolo vangu Vayawudi na nyenye vanu vonda yemwikwikala baha ku Yelusalemu, mpulikiche unofu njowo chedandikuvalongela. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Vanu ava sevagalile ngita pemwihocha, nonde saa chidatu pamilau hela. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ndakyene makani aga ndi gala gealongile Yoeli mvichi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Nguluvi alongile, mufigono fila fya mwiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Ndikuvasukulila Muhe vangu Ung'alile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Vana venu vakigosi na vakidala davakuvalongela vanu njowo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Vadimi venu vilola maono gya njowo dachechihumila pambele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na vagogolo venu vilota njosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Hata kwa vanyigendwa vangu vakigosi na vadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">ndikuvamemicha Muhe vangu mufigono fila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">navo filanducha unanzi vangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ndigita umanyitu kuluhano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na kimanyilo panyi muinyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kuvecha na Danda na lyoto na lyosi tii,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />lichuwa litabadilika kuvecha kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na mwechi uvecha mdung'u ngita danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">peyave kufika kigono kila kikomi kya Ukomi va Mtwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Baho yeyonda yeisuka kwa litawa lya Mtwa, iwokolelwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Peteli akaendelie kulonga, nyenye vanu va Isilaeli, mpulikiche njowo ichi unofu! Nguluvi akavawonise nyenye kuva igita kasi kuchumbila Yesu va Nasaleti nyenye mwichela kuva kuchumbila uyo Yesu akaonise fimanyilo fyolofu kwa nyenye. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kuhumila na mpango vake Nguluvi yumwene akali asakile kuva Yesu ibatwe na nyenye, nyenye mukamdochile kwa kuvaleka vanu vahofu vamuvambe mulipindilihicho. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ila Nguluvi akamchulubuche, akamuhecha mukiwopo kya kufua, ili abihile kukolelwa na kufuwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dawudi alongile njowo cha Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Ndimwene Mtwa pautalo lyangu figono fyonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">kwakuva mwene agehe pepi na nene sendivecha na wogofi ng'oo.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kwa ifyo, numbula lyangu ukeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Kangi ndikeduka kwa mlomo gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">na muvili vangu wikwikala kwa uhuvilo<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwakuva veve Nguluvi seukunileka muinyi lya vanu vevafuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">vala kumleka mng'alili vako awole ukoya kwa vanu vevafuwe.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Uniwonise genditakilwa kugita na gyegikunilongocha kuwumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">daukundigita ndikeduke kwakuva ugehe pamwinga na nene.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Vakolo vangu, ndikela kuvalongela ndakyene gala gegampatile daada vetu Dawudi, akafue na kusilwa na likabuli lyake ligehe baha mbaka neng'uli. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Lakini kwakuva ng'achale Dawudi akali Mvichi, achele kuva Nguluvi amlapie kilapo, kuva akumuhagula yumwi kuhuma mukilelo kyake aveche mhala vake. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dawudi agawonile suwe makani gyegagitwa na Nguluvi na akalongile uchulubuko va Kilisito chipindi pealongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">Sealekilwe muinyi lya vanu vevafuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">na mvili vake seuwola mulikabuli.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Nguluvi akamchulubuche Yesu na nefwe tuvalolaji va luchowo ulo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Baho Daada Nguluvi akamgavile unginyange kuchumba vonda neke atavale pamwi nave, akawanuke Muhe va Nguluvi kuhuma kwa Daada atuletie Muhe va Nguluvi ambaye Nguluvi akatulongie, nde kyemukiwona na kupulika nonde. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwakuva Dawudi seanyamuliwe kuhelela kuluhano, ila alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">Mtwa akamlongile Mtwa vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">kale lubali lwangu lwa kuliya,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka pendikuvagita machundwama vako vaginywe panyi lya magulu gyako.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Peteli akalongile “Vanu vonda va Isilaeli ndakyene ving'ang'wa kuchela kuva, uyu Yesu yevamukong'oliche mulipindilihicho, Nguluvi amgitile kuva Mtwa na Kilisito Mkombosi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Vanu pevapulike njowo icho, vakasugwime hilo munumbula chao, vakavahucha Peteli na vala vanjagila vayawo, “Vakolo vetu, tugite liki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Peteli akavahigile, “Kila yumwi venu ahongeche sambi chake na abatiswe kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilisito, Nguluvi akuvawonela lusungu sambi chenu. Na nyenye mwikwanuka fupo lya Nguluvi ambalyo ndi Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwakuva, fupo ilyo ivikilwe kwajili lyenu na vana venu na vanu vonda yevagehe kutali na vala vonda ambavo Nguluvi daavakemela yumwene.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa njowo cholofu Peteli avakanyile vanu, akilonga, “Mujiwokole mukilelo iki kiwofu!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Vanu volofu vakadikile njowo chake, vakabatiswa. Kigono kila vanu ngita elufu chidatu vakahongelike mulipinga lila lya vamdikie Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Ava vonda vakaendeliye kuwulanichwa na vanjagila, kwikala pamwi na kuliya kyakuliya pamwi na kumsuka Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pevakalile yevamdikile Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Vanjagila vagitile umanyitu na filuwiluwi fyolofu, vanu volofu vakadudwive hilo na kumginya Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vonda yevamdikie Yesu vakaendeliye kwikala pamwi na finu fyawo vagavine pamwi. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Vakali vegucha mali na finu fyawo na kugavana munu sendi ngita peakela mwene. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Figono fyonda vakali vikutang'anila mu Kaye lya Nguluvi. Ila chipindi kya kuliya, vakatang'anila mukaye chawo na kuliya kyakula kwa lukeduko na numbula lwa uwekelelo, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />vamunjuma Nguluvi na kukelwa na vanu vonda. Kila kigono Mtwa akali iluticha lipinga lya vanu yevakali vekuwokoliwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Peteli na Yohani vekumnanicha mtenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Kigono kimwi, Peteli na Yohani vakahelela Kukaye lya Nguluvi saa tisa pamunyi, kipindi ikyo ndikyo kikali kya kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Na ukoya mu Kaye lya Nguluvi kukali na munu yumwi mtenda kuhuma peababilwe. Kila kigono vanu vakali vekumvika munu uyo mumlyangilo lya kaye lya Nguluvi weukemelwe, “Mlyangilo mnofu,” neke asuke kinu kyokyonda kwa vanu vevikwingila mu kaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Yula mtenda peavawene Peteli na Yohani pevikwingila mukaye lya Nguluvi, akavasuka vamgavile kyokyonda. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peteli na Yohani vamfulutulie meho, Peteli akamlongie, “Utulole!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Mwene akavalola akahochile igavilwa kinu kuhuma kwavene. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Baho Peteli akamlongie, “Nene ndihela madini gya fesa vala sahabu, ila kyendinakyo nene ndikugavila. Kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilisito va Nasaleti, wime na ubite!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Baho Peteli akamkolile liwoko lya kuliya, akamnamue. Bahobaho magulu na mafugamilo gyake gyapatile ludali. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akang'etuka, akawime na kuvanga kugenda. Baho akaingile pamwinga navo mukaye lya Nguluvi, akigenda na kung'etukang'etuka kuno akimnjuma Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Vanu vonda vevakali bahala pevamwene egenda na kumnjuma Nguluvi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />vanu pevakammanyile kuva yula ndi yeakali isukasuka mumlyangilo mnofu va kaye lya Nguluvi, vakadudwive hilo makani gegamuhumile.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi va Peteli mukaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Yula mtenda yeananichwe peakali ilongochana na Peteli na Yohani, vanu vonda vakadudwive hilo, vakachile kuno vinyila mbaka muludamwa lweukemelwa, “Ludamwa lwa Solomoni.” <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Suwe, Peteli peavawene vanu avo akavalongie, vanu va Isilaeli, wuli mwiduduva na luchowo ulu? Wuli mukutufutulila meho muhocha kuva ndi kwa umwimike vetu awu kwa usanzi vetu tumgitile munu uyu awese kugenda? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nguluvi va daada vetu, Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, ndive akamnjumile Yesu unyingendwa vake. Ila nyenye mukambatile neke adochwe, na nyenye mkamkanile pautalo lya Pilato, hata ngita Pilato asakile amleke abihile kuhigwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Akali Mng'alile na msanzi, ila nyenye mkamlema, mkamkela munu yungi yeakali mdochi adindulilwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mkamdocha yula yakali mvangilo va wumii. Ila Nguluvi akamchulubuche na nefwe ndi valola va luchowo ulo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwa kulidikila litawa lya Yesu munu uyu yemkumchela fihundo fya magulu fyake vigavilwe ludali. Mbatwa lyake kwa Yesu nde imnaniche ndakyene munu uyu ngita pemukumlola vonda. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Nano lukololo vangu ndichela kuva, nyenye na vakomi venu mugitile ago kwakuva semkachelile. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ila Nguluvi atimise gala gyealongile kuchumbila vavichi vake, imtakilwe Kilisito vake agudwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Suwe, muhogeche na mumuwuyile Nguluvi, neke mulekelwe sambi chenu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mukigita ndeni neke Mtwa avaongelechele umwimike kukeduka munumbula, mwene akuvaletela Yesu kilisito yeavahagulie nyenye. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Mwene itakilwa asigalie kuluhano mbaka njowo chonda pechivecha miya, ngita Nguluvi pealongie daha kuchumbila vavichi vake vang'alile. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kwakuva Musa akalongie, ‘Mtwa Nguluvi ekuvaletela mvichi vake ngita peandiletile nene, uyu ihumila mugati lyenu nyenye. Mwitakilwa mupulike kila kinu kyeakuvalongela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Munu yoyonda yeilema kumpulika mvichi uyo inengwa kuhuma kwa vanu va Nguluvi na idochwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Vavichi va Nguluvi vonda kuvangila Samweli na vala vachile kumbele lyake, vonda vakalagule njowo chechigitwa figono ifi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Fupo ambalyo Nguluvi akahechile kuchumbila vavichi ndi kwa nyenye, na nyenye mwisiliki muliagano ambalyo Nguluvi akaligitile na paapo, ngita peamlongie Ibulahimu, ‘Kwa kuchumbila ulelo vako vanu va inyi chonda vifunywa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nguluvi peamchulubuche Yesu mnyegendwa vake, tandi amlagiliche kwa nyenye, avafunye na kumgita kila yumwinga venu aleke kugita mahofu.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Peteli na Yohani visindikwa muludamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Peteli na Yohani pevakali veywanga na vanu, vatekechi na mkomi va vadima va kaye lya Nguluvi na vasadukayo vakafikile. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Vakavipie hilo kwakuva vala vanjagila vavili Peteli na Yohani vakali vekuvawulanicha vanu kuva Yesu achulubuke, njowo lyeliwonesa wachi kuva vanu yevafuwe vichulubuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ifyo peifikile palumie vakavabata Peteli na Yohani na kuvikwa mukiwopo mbaka pamilau lyake. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ila vanu volofu yevapulike unanzi wula wevalongile Peteli na Yohani vauwidikie na vakali ngita vakigosi elufu chihano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Kilau lyake, vakomi va Vayawudi na vagogolo na vawulanichi va Malagilicho vakatang'anile pamwinga ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Palidamo ulo kukali na mtekechi mkomi Anasi pamoja na Kayafa na Yohani na Alekisanda na vangi vakali vakololo va mtekechi mkomi. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Pevakavahimiche Peteli na Yohani pautalo lyawo, vakavawuchile, “Nyenye mwigitile njowo ichi kwa umwimike va ani na kwa litawa lya ani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Baho Peteli, kuno akilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, akahigile, “Nyenye valongochi na vagogolo va vanu. <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ngita neng'uli tuwuchwa chila njowo chinofu cheagitilwe yula munu yeakali mtenda na ananichwe wuli, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />nyenye na vanu vonda va Isilaeli muchele kuva munu uyu ikwima palutalo lyenu akiva ananile ni kwa umwimike va Yesu Kilisito va Nasaleti. Uyo nde Yesu yemkamdochile mukamvambile mulipindilihicho na Nguluvi amchulubuche kuhuma kwa vevafuwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Uyu nde yula Masimbo Mang'alili gakumlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Liganga lyemulikanile nyenye vachengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">nano nde liganga likomi lya kuchengela.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Wokofu seupatikana kwa munu yungi yeyonda, kwakuva kuinyi yonda, vanu sevagavilwe litawa lya munu yungi lyeliwesa kutukombola nefwe.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Vala vakomi va ludamo, kuno vichela kuva Peteli na Yohani vakali vanu vesevimbile, vakadudwive pevavapulike viywanga kwa ukakatima ifyo vakavachela kuva vagehe na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ila kwakuva vamwene yula munu yeananichwe imile pamwi na Peteli na Yohani, vakalemwile kulonga kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ifyo, vakavaswitilicha vahume kwivala lya ludamo, baho vakomi va ludamo vaywangine kwa lupwepo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Vakomi va ludamo vahuchine, “Tugite liki na vanu ava? Kwakuva vanu vonda vevikala ku Yelusalemu vichela kuva vagitile njowo ngomi na nefwe setuwesa kukana njowo ichi. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Lakini neke tuchikane njowo ichi chibihile kulutala kwa vanu, tuvakanile vabihile kumlongela kangi na munu yeyonda kwa litawa lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Baho vakavakemele kangi mgati na kuvaswitilicha vabihile kulonga kangi na kuwulanicha kwa litawa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ila Peteli na Yohani vakahigile, “Mlonge nyenye ngita ndeunofu kuvapulikicha nyenye awu kumpulikicha Nguluvi? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwakuva nefwe setuwesa kuleka kugalonga gala getugawonile na getugapulike.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Vavaha va ludamo vakavakanile hilo, baho vakavaleka vahelele. Sevakawesile kuvagavila asabu, kwakuva vanu vonda vakali vakimnjuma Nguluvi kwa gala kegakali gahumie. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Munu uyu yeananichwe akali na miyaka yeigine alobaini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vevamdikie Yesu visuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bahobaho Peteli na Yohani pevalekilwe, vakawuyile kwa vayawo, vakavalongie gala gegalongilwe na vatekechi vakomi na vagololo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Vanu avo pevapulike ago, vakamsukile Nguluvi kwa pamwinga, vakilonga, Mtwa veve yeumbile luhano na inyi na inyanza na finu fyonda fyefigehe. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ukalongile kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi kwa kuchumbila mnyigendwa vako, daada vetu Dawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“Wuli vanu se Vayawudi vavipile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Wuli vanu vihocha njowo chiwofu. <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Vang'achale va inyi viandalise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na vilongochi vatang'ane pamwinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">kumlema Mtwa na Kilisito vake.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwakuva Helode na Ponito Pilato na vanu va inyi lya Isilaeli na vanu sevakali Vayawudi vatang'anile ku mwani ugu va Yelusalemu, kumkana Yesu, mnyegendwa vako mng'alile, yemuhagule aveche mkombosi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ndakyene vatang'anile neke kugagita gala geugakeliye na kupanga kuhuma pamwandi kwa umwimike vako na kwakukela veve. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ndonde Mtwa lole vekutuogofya, ututange nefwe vanyigendwa vako, tuvese kulonga njowo chako kwa ukakatima. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Veve wonese ludali lwako lwa kuvananicha vatamwa na ututange neke tugite umanyitu golofu kuchumbila litawa lya Yesu mnyigendwa mng'alile.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Pevamalile kusuka, pono pala pevatang'ane pakahogosilwe, Muhe va Nguluvi akavalongocha vonda, vakaendeliye kulonga njowo cha Nguluvi kwa ukakatima.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vevamdikie Yesu vikwikala ngita lukolo lumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Vanu vonda vevadikie vakali na numbula yimwi na lihocho limwi. Kwihela hata yumwi yeakali na kinu kyokyonda na kuvika kuvecha kinu kyake yumwene, ila vagavine finu fyonda fyevakalinafyo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Vanjagila vaendeleliye kulonga kwa ukakatima kuchulubuka kwa Yesu na Nguluvi akuvafunyile hilo. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Kwihela munu yoyonda yeakali ihela kinu, kwakuva vanu yevakali na migunda awu kaye vaguchile na kusindika sendi chonda chevakaguchilile, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kuvagavila vanjagila, navo vanjagila vakavagavie vanu ngita kila yumwi pevakeliye.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kukali na Mlawi yumwi yeahumile mwani va Kupulo, litawa lyake Yusufu, vanjagila vamkemeliye Balinaba mana lyake, “Munu va kuvakolela mawoko vanu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Akaguchile mgunda yeakalinalyo, akasindike chila sendi cheapatile na kuvagavila vanjagila.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Kwichanga kwa Anania na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Pakali na munu yumwi litawa lyake Anania, pamwi na mdala vake Safila, vakaguchile mgunda lyao. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ila Anania na mdala vake vakapatine kufiya pono lya sendi chevapatile na kusindika pono lya sendi yeisigie kwa vanjagila. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Baho Peteli akamuhuchile, Anania wuli mlekile setani akwingie munumbula lyako na kukugita umchange Muhe va Nguluvi, kwakufiya sendi chingi cheuguchie mgunda vako? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Pewave kugucha mgunda ukali vako na peuguchile, sendi chikali chako, wuli ulamuwe kugita njowo ilyi? Veve seumchangile munu, ila umchangile Nguluvi? <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bahobaho Anania peapulike njowo icho, akague panyi afuwe. Vanu vonda vevapulike luchowo ilyo, vakaogwipe hilo. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Vadimi vakafikile, vakanyamuwe ligubiko vakaugubikile mvili vake, vakauhumicha kwivala na vakausila.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Pegachumbile ngita masaa gadatu, mdala vake seachelile njowo chochonda chechimuhumie mgosi vake, akaingie mugati. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Peteli akamhuchile, “Nilongele, wuli ichi sendi chonda chempatile pemguchile mgunda?” Safila akamhigile, “Ndakyene, nde chicho.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Peteli akamuhuchile, “Wuli veve na mgosi vako mpatine kumchanga Muhe va Nguluvi va Mtwa? Pulike! Vala vanu vakahelele kumusila mgosi vako, nonde vegehe kwivala lya mlyangilo na vakukutegula na veve ndena” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bahobaho Safila akague panyi pepi na magulu gya Peteli, akafuwa. Vala vadimi peviingie vakamwene afuwe, ifyo vakamuhumicha kwivala, vakahele kumusila pepi na mgosi vake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Lipinga lyonda lya vanu vonda vevakali vakumdikila Yesu na vanu vonda vevapulike njowo chila vakaogwipe hilo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanjagila vakuvananicha vanu volofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Vanjagila vakagitile umanyitu na fimanyilo fyolofu pavanu. Vadikila vakali vatang'ana pamwi mulidamwa lya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Vanu yesevamwidikie Yesu vakali vakuvanjuma hilo. Hata ifyo kwihela ambalye akagelile kulongochana navo kwakuva vakaogwipe. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Hata ifyo vanu vevamwidikie Mtwa likahongeleke hilo vagosi kwa vadala. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Kuhumila na gala gyevagitile vanjagila, vanu vakali vakuvasindika vatamwa mung'asi na kuvagonecha paulili na pakitefu neke peichumba Peteli, linyigi lyake livachumbile mukyanya lyawo na kivananiche. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Vanu volofu vafikile kumwani lya mung'umbung'umbu lya ku Yelusalemu, vakavaletile vatamwa vawo na vala vakali na lihoka, navo vonda vakananichwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanjagila va Yesu vigudwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Baho mtekechi mkomi na vayage, vanu va lipinga lya Vasadukayo va pono pala, vakavawonela wifu vanjagila na vakalamule kuvakanila. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Vakavabatile vanjagila na kuvavika mukihopo. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ila vakati va pamie ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, achile na akadindue mlyangilo mkomi va mukihopo akavahumiche kwivala avalongie, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Muhele na mukakwime ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, mkavalongie vanu njowo chonda cha wumi ugu umiya.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Vanjagila vakadikile, vakaingile ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, nyolasagala, vakavanga kuvawulanicha vanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mtekechi mkomi na vayage pevafikile, vekekung'ese mulidamo, pambele vakavalagilicha vadima va kihopo vavalete vala vanjagila kuhuma mukihopo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ila vala vapuga va Kaye lya Nguluvi pevafikile ukoya sevavawene. Vakawuyile muludamo kuvalongela njowo icho, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />vakalonga, “Tuwene milyangilo gyonda mukihopo gidindilwe na vadima vakuudima milyangilo. Ila petudinduwe mlyangilo setumwene munu yeyonda mugati!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ila mkomi va vapuga va Kaye lya Nguluvi, filongochi na vatekechi vala pevapulike ago, vakasugwime hilo, vakahuchine namuna njowo dachivecha. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Munu yumwi akachile akavalongie, “Mpulikiche vala vanu vemvadindile mukihopo, nondee vakuvawulanicha vanu ukoya ku Kaye lya Nguluvi!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Baho mkomi va vapuga va Kaye lya Nguluvi pamwi na vanu vake vakahele ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, vakavaletile mulidamo, ila sevatumile ludali kwakuva vakavaongwipe vanu ngavatova na maganga.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Vakavasindika vala vanjagila na vakavahimiche pautalo lwa ludamo. Mtekechi mkomi akavahuchile, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tukavakanile kuwulanicha kwa litawa lya munu uyu, nondee mlole kyemgitile mgalutiche mawulanicho gyenu ponda ku Yelusalemu na mukutuswitilicha nefwe kwa kufuwa kwa munu uyu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Peteli pamwi na vanjagila vangi vahigile, “Tung'ang'wa kumpulika Nguluvi na se kuvapulika vanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nyenye mukamdochile Yesu kwa kumkong'olela mulipindilihicho ila Nguluvi va daada vetu amchulubuche. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nguluvi amnamule na kumvika uginyange kuchumba vonda na kumgita aveche Mkomi na Mkombosi, neke aveche kuvagite vanu va Isilaeli vachileke sambi chawo na Nguluvi avalekele sambi chawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Nefwe tuchiwene njowo icho na Muhe va Nguluvi yeavagavile Nguluvi kwa vala yevakumpilika na mwene mlola va njowo icho.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Vananzi vonda va mulidamo pevapulike ago, vakavavipie, vakalamuwe kuvadocha vanjagila. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ila Mfalisayo yumwi litawa lyake Gamalieli, yeakali muwulanichi va malagilicho na yeanginywa hilo na vanu vonda, akaimile pautalo lya lila ludamo, akasakile vala vanjagila vahumichwe kwivala kwa muda mdodo. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Baho akavalongie vala vananzi va muludamo, “Vaisilaeli vayangu, mwilolele kinu kyemwisaka kuvagitila vanu ava! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Dahile ludodo, kukahumie munu yumwi litawa lyake Teuda, alongile mwene ndi munu mkomi na vanu mya chitai vakaungine nave. Ila akadochwa, baho vanu vake vakayaganika na kasi lyake ikasilile baho. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Pambele lyake kangi, chipindi cha kuvalilwa vanu, akahumile Yuda va ku Galilaya. Mwene akavakwega vanu vakamfuatila, ila na mwene fifila akadochwa na vapinga vake vakayaganika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nondee ndikuvalongela mu njowo ichi, mbihile kuvagita kinu kyokyonda vanu ava, muvaleke! Ngita njowo ichi chivangichwe na vanu na chiyaganika chene. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ila ngita ivangichwe na Nguluvi, damuvesa hamu kuvakanila ila damvecha mukumpinga Nguluvi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Ludamo londa vedikie gyealongile Gamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Vakavakemela vala vanjagila, vakaswitilicha vatovwe ndomondo na kuvakanila vabihile kuwulanicha kangi kwa litwa lya Yesu, baho vakaleka vahele. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Vanjagila vakahumile kwivala lya lila ludamo kuno vikeduka hilo, kwakuva vakali ving'ang'wa kuhingwa kwajili lya litawa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Sevalekile kuvawulanichila vanu na kuvadalikila Njowo Chinofu kuva Yesu ndi Kilisito. Vakaendelie kuwulanicha figono fyonda ku Kaye lya Nguluvi na ku kaye cha vanu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vatanga saba va vanjagila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mufigono ifyo, vadikila vakali vigina kuhongeleka, kukahumile mang'ung'unilo mugati lya vadikilwa veviywanga Kigiliki na vala veviywanga Kiebulania. Vala veviywanga Kigiliki vakang'ung'utile kuva vagane vawo visemwa kugavilwa fyakuliya kila kigono. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Vala vanjagila kumi na vavili vakavakemeliye vala vevamdikie Yesu, vakavalongie, “Se unofu nefwe tuleke kulanducha luchowo lya Nguluvi na kuvagavila kya kyakuliya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Suwe lukololo vangu, muhagule vanu saba pagati lyenu yevali vanofu, vevamemile ludali lwa Nguluvi na vevali na unginyange na avo ndi tukuvagavila kasi lya kuvagava kyakula. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Na nefwe twikala figono fyonda kusuka na kuwulanicha luchowo lwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Gala gyevalongile gagavakelise vanu vonda. Vakavahaguwe Sitefano, munu munya mbatwa ngomi na yeamemilwe Muhe va Nguluvi, Filipo na Pulokolo na Nikanoli na Timona na Palimena na Nikolayo va Anitiokia yeakali aokokile mudini lya Kiyawudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Vakavavikile palutalo lya vanjagila, navo vakavavikila mawoko na vakavasukie.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Luchowo lya Nguluvi likagina kulutala na vadikilwa ukoya ku Yelusalemu ikahongelike hilo na lipinga likomi lya vatekechi vakamdikie Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano ibatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Nguluvi akamfunyile Sitefano na kumgavila ludali lwa kugita umunyitu na fimanyilo fikomi kwa vanu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Vamonga va vanu vevahumile kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi yeikemelwe, “Kaye lya kutang'anila vanu hulu.” Vangi vahumile Kulene na Alekisandilia na vevahumile ku Kilikiya na mkowa va Asia, vakavangile kulumbana na Sitefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ila sevawesile kumkana kwakuva lya unginyange lwake na kwakuva lya yula Muhe yamulongochile chipindi peilonga. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Suwe, vakavayovelela vanu vamonga neke valonge, “Tumpulikiche Sitefano njowo cha kumpinja Musa na ekumliga Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa njowo icho vakavalongela vanu na vagogolo na vawulanichi va malagilicho. Navo vakamweleliye Sitefano, vakambatile na kumsindika palutalo lya lidamo likomi lya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Vakavaletile valola va udesi palutalo lya lidamo yevalongie, “Munu uyu seileka kulonga makani mawofu ku kaye baha lya Nguluvi na pakyanya lya malagilicho gya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwakuva tukampulikile akilongile kuva uyu Yesu va Nasaleti daitunyula Kaye lya Nguluvi na kutiligicha kutali malagilicho getugavilwe na Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Vanu vonda vevakali mula mulidamo vakamuhulutie meho Sitefano, vakauwene wuso vake uvechile ngita ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Unanzi va Sitefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Suwe, Mtekechi Mkomi akamuwuchile Sitefano, “Wuli, njowo ichi ndi ndakyene?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Sitefano akavahigile, lukololo vangu na daada vangu, mnipulikiche! Mgogolo vetu Ibulahimu pehave kuhelela kwikala Halani Ukomi va Nguluvi ukamuhumie ukoya ku Mesopotami. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nguluvi amlongie, uhege muinyi lyako na uvaleke vanu vako na uhelele mu inyi dandikuwonesa! <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ibulahimu akailekile inyi lya Vakalidayo, akahele kwikala Halani. Peafue daada vake, Nguluvi akamuhumiche Halani na kumleta akale muinyi iyi yemwikwikala nondee. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nguluvi seamgavile hata pono padodo pa inyi iyi iveche lyake, ila Nguluvi akamlongie kuva mwene na ulelo vake, akumgavila inyi iyi, angava chipindi ikyo Ibulahimu seakali na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nguluvi akamlongie ndeni, filelo fyako fisindikwa muinyi ambayo se yavo navo vigitwa vasutu na kugitwa unjanganifu kwa myaka miya chitai. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ila nene ndikuvatova vanu va inyi ilyo yeikuvagita nyenye kuvecha vasutu, baho ndikuvahumicha ku inyi ilyo vache pono baha vanilumbe. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nguluvi amlagiliche Ibulahimu kudumula bina iveche kimanyilo kya Lyagano lyake. Ifyo Ibulahimu amdumule bina Isaka kigono kya nane peababilwe. Na Isaka amdumule bina mwana vake Yakobo. Yakobo agitile ndeni kwa vala vavaha vetu kumi na vavili. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Kwakuva vavaha vetu vamwonilie wifu Yusufu lukololo vawo, vakamguchile, ngita msutu ku Misili. Ila Nguluvi akali pamwi na Yusufu, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />akamwokola kuhuma pamagudo gyonda. Nguluvi akamgavile umwimike na akamkelise Falaho ng'achale va ku Misili, hata Falaho akamvikile aveche mkomi va inyi lyonda na mkomi va kaye lya king'achale. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Pambele kukahumie na lumyai muinyi yonda lya Kumisili na Kanani, yeigitile kuhumila utatala mkomi na kyakuliya kikavasilie vagogolo vetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakobo peapulike kuva ukoya ku Misili kigehe kyakula, akavalagiche vana vake, ndi vagogolo vetu vahele ukoya ku Misili kwa mala lya kwanja. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Pevahelele mala lya uvili, Yusufu ichelise kwa lukololo vake, Falaho ng'achale va ku Misili akavachela lukolo va Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yusufu akalagicha vanu vakamkemele Yakobo daada vake pamwi na lukololo vake, vonda vakali vanu sabini na vahanu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ndeni Yakobo akahele ku Misili, mwene na vagogolo vetu vonda vakafue ukoya. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mifimba gwao ikawuyiswe Shekemu, ikasiilwe pa likabuli yeagulile Ibulahimu, kuhuma kwa vana va Hamoli ukoya Shekemu kwa sendi ndodo.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Chipindi pekifikile kya Nguluvi kugita kila kyeamlongie Ibulahimu, vanu vetu vakababile na kwongeleka ukoya ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Baho ng'achale yumwi yeseamchelile Yusufu akavangile kulongocha ukoya ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ng'achale uyo avagitile vakolo vetu uwakata na vakavaswitilicha vagogolo vetu vavatage fyali fwao kwivala neke vafue. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Muchipindi chila Musa akababilwe na akali mwana mnofu hilo, alelilwe mukaye lya daada vake kwa myechi chidatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />pevalemwile kumfiya vakamtagile, muhinja va Ng'achale Falaho akamholile na kumlela ngita mwana vake. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa akawulanichwa njowo chonda chauginyange cha Vamisili na akavechile munu yeakali na umwimike kwa kulonga na kwa kugagita.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Musa peakali na myaka alobaini akalamue kuhelela kuvagendelela vakolo vake Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ukoya amwene lukolo vake yumwi igitilwa uwofu na Misili, akahele kumutanga, kwa kupilusa kisasi akamtova yula Mmisili na kumdocha. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa akahochile lukolo vake vangichela kuva Nguluvi amlagiche mwene kuvawokola, ila vawo sevachele. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Pamilau lyake, avawene Vaisilaeli vavili vikwitova, akagecha kuvapatanisa akilonga, ‘Nyenye nde lukolo, wuli mwikwigitila unjanganifu mwavene?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Yula yeakali akumtova muyage akamsung'ile Musa palubali, akamwucha, ‘Ndi ani yeakuvikile veve kuva mkomi na mswitilicha vetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Wuli, wikela kunidocha ngita golo peumdochile yula Mmisili?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa peapulike njowo icho, akanyilila ukoya ku Midiani peakalile ngita mgenji na ukoya akababile vana vavili va kigosi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Peichumbile myaka alobaini, ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi akamuhumie Musa pakisako kyekikali kikwaka lyoto ukoya kukwelu, pepi na kidunda Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa akaduduve hilo kulola kinu ikyo akahegelile pepi neke alolele unofu, ila akapulike lichwo lya Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Nene ndi Nguluvi va daada vako, Nguluvi va Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo.’ Musa akaogwipe hilo na seagechile kulola. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mtwa akamlongie, ‘fule makobasi gyako, kwakuva pono baha pewimile ndi pono pang'alile. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Niyawene magudo gevigitilwa vanu vangu ukoya ku Misili. Nipulike kivembo kyao, nene ndikile kwacha kuvawokola, suwe nondee dandikulagicha ku Misili.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Uyu ndi Musa yula vamkanile vakilonga, ‘Ndi ani akugitile uveche mkomi na mswiticha vetu?’ Nde yula yealagilichwe na Nguluvi kuva mkomi na muwokola kuchumbila ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi yeamuhumie Musa pakisako kyekikali kikwaka lyoto. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yeavalongochile vanu va Vaisilaeli kuhuma ku Misili, kwa kugita filuviluvi na umanyitu myolofu ku inyi lya Misili na ku inyanza lya Shamu na kwa myaka alobaini kukwelu. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa mwene avalongie vanu Vaisilaeli, ‘Nguluvi akuvaletela mvichi vake ngita peaniletile nene kuhuma mugati mwa vakolo venu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Musa akali pamwi na vagogolo vetu mulipinga kukwelu, yeaywangile na ndumindumi va kuluhano kukidunda Sinai, akawanuke njowo cha wumi neke atugavile nefwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Ila vagogolo vetu vakanile kumpulikicha Musa, badili lyake vakamkana na kudoboka kuwuya ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Vakamlongie Haluni, ‘Tugitile valungu vangi vatulongoche mu ng'asi, kwakuva Musa yeatulongoliche kuhuma ku Misili setuchela gegamhumie ukoya.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Baho vakagitile lig'omong'omo ngita ngwada, vakakihumichie usembe va kunyanya na kugitila lihungu kinu kyevagitile kwa mawoko gyawo vavene. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ila Nguluvi akahegile pagati lyao, akavalekile vafunye nondwa na finu fya kuluhano, ngita peisimbilwe mukiganilo kya vavichi va Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">nyenye vanu va Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Se nene yemunihumichile usembe va vang'oko na usembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kwa myaka alobaini ukoya kukwelu! <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nyenye mlikitegula kyama kya mlungulu Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Na ling'omong'omo lya nondwa lya mlungulu venu Lefani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Fing'omong'omo fyemfigitile nde mkafifunyile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Kwa ifyo ndikuvasindika vasutu kutali kuchumba Babeli.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Ukoya kukwelu vagogolo vetu vakali na kyama kya kuvawonesa kuva Nguluvi agehe pamwi navo. Lyeligalanichwe ngita Nguluvi peamlongie Musa agite, kuwananisa ngita peawoniswe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Baho vagogolo vetu vanjanukine kyama ikyo vene kwa vene, mbaka chipindi cha Yoshua, pevategule inyi yila kuhuma kwa vanu yesevakali Vaisilaeli, yevadagilwe na Nguluvi, kyama kila kikasiglie bahala mbaka chipindi cha Dawudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawudi akamkelise Nguluvi, nave Dawudi akamsuka Nguluvi amleke amchengie kaye mwene Nguluvi va Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ila Solomoni nde yeamchengie Nguluvi kaye. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ata ndeni, Nguluvi yeagehe kukyanya hilo seakwikala mukaye chechichengilwe na vanu, ngita mvichi vake pealongie,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Mtwa ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">kuluhano ni kigoda kyangu kya ung'achale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na inyi ndi pono panene pakuvikila magulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Kaye yeigehe wuli dakunichengela nene kwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">awu pono pakutulula nene kwivecha kwiya?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Wuli, se nene yendigitile finu fyonda ifyo?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Pambele Sitefano akaendeleye kulonga, “Nyenye vanu ndi vapuva! Masigicha na numbula chenu ndi ngita vanu yesevakumchela Nguluvi, nyenye ngita vagogolo venu. Figono fyonda mukumkana Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Wuli, kugehe na mvichi yeyonda yeseagudwe na vagogolo venu? Navo vakavadocha, Nguluvi avalagiliche vala valanduche kwacha kwa mwene yula yeakali msanji, nondee nyenye mumkanile na mumdochile. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Nyenye muwanuke malagilicho gya Nguluvi lyeliletilwe kwa nyenye kuchumbila vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, ila semwidikie.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano idochwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Vala vagogolo va ludamo pevapulikile ago, vakavipile hilo na vakakekene kumeho. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ila Sitefano kwa kulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, akalolile kukyanya kuluhano, akauwene ukomi va Nguluvi na Yesu agavilwe unginyange kuchumba vonda. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akalonga, “Lole! Ndiwene kuluhano kudinduliwe na Mwana va Munu imile palubali lya ndewo kwa Nguluvi!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Vakakanile kumpulikicha, vakadinda matu gyao, vakabwatile navo vakamng'etukila Sitefano. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Vakamhumicha kwivala lya kumwani, vakamtovile kwa maganga. Vala vevakali vakumtova vakafulile mikoti gyawo na vakavika panyi pamagulu gya mdimi yeikemelwa Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Pevaendeliye kumtova kwa maganga Sitefano akamlumba Nguluvi, “Mtwa Yesu iyanuke muhe vangu!”<figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7.59">Munu idochwa kwa maganga</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Baho akafugame, akavembile kwa lichwi likomi akalongile, “Mtwa, vambonile lusungu sambi iyi.” Peamalile kulonga ago, akafue.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sauli mwene awonile njowo chila cha kumdocha Sitefano kuva nofu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli avagudisa lipinga lya vadikila va Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Kigono ikyo ikyo lipinga lya vadikila va Kilisito va ku Yelusalemu vavangile kugundwa. Vadikila vonda vakanyilie mufijiji fya Yudea na Samalia, vakasigalie vanjagila hela. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Vanu vevimfunya Nguluvi vakamsihile Sitefano na vakamvembile hilo.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Sauli akagechile kuvadocha lipinga lya vadikila va Kilisito. Akahele kaye kwa kaye na kuvahecha kwivala vadikila vagosi kwa vadala na kuvavika mukiwopo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo Nofu idalikwa ku Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Vanu vala yevayaganile vakahele kila pono kudalika Njowo cha Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipo akahele ku mwani va Samalia na kuvadalikila vanu Njowo Nofu cha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Vanu vikung'ise na kumpulikicha Filipo kwa unofu na kulola gila umanyitu geagita. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mihoka ikavahumile vanu volofu kuno vibwatika na vanu venye lugaso na vatenda vananichwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Vanu va mwani wula vakakeduke hilo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kukali na munu yumwi litawa lyake Simoni, mwene akali igita uhavi mu mwani ugo kwa chipindi kitali na kuvaduduva va ku Samalia. Akali akwinjuma mwene nde munu mkomi, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />vanu vonda, vakomi kwa vadodo, vampulikiche kwa unofu valongie, “Simoni nde uwimike va Nguluvi yeichelwa ngita, ‘Uwimike Mkomi’” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Vanu vakali vakumpulikicha, kwakuva akali akuvadudwiva kwa kasi lya uhavi vake kwa chipindi kitali. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ila vanu pevadikie Njowo Nofu cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi na Njowo cha Yesu Kilisito weudalikilwe na Filipo, vanu vonda vakabatiswa, vagosi na vadala. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Nave Simoni akadikila na kubatiswa, akali akwilongocha na Filipo kila pono, akiduduva na fimanyilo na fimanyitu fikomi fyeafiwene figitwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Vala vanjagila vevakali ukoya ku Yelusalemu pevapulike kuva venyekaye va Samalia navo vakalidikile luchowo lwa Nguluvi, vakavalagilicha ukoya Peteli na Yohani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Pevafikile, vakavasukilila vala vadikila kwa Nguluvi, neke vamwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kwakuva chipindi ikyo Muhe va Nguluvi seakali amwikie munu yeyonda pagati lyao, ila vakabatiswe kwa litawa lya Mtwa Yesu weka hela. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Baho Peteli na Yohani vakavavikile mawoko gyao na kuvalumbila kwa Nguluvi, navo vakawanuke Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni peawonile kuva vanu vamwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi kwa kuvikilwa mawoko na vanjagila. Ifyo akang'alile kuvagavila sendi Peteli na Yohani, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />akalongie, “Mnigavile na nene umwimike ugo, neke munu yeyonda yendikumvikila mawoko, amuwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ila Peteli akamhigile, “Uyage patali pamwi na Sendi chako, wihocha kuva wivesa kugula umwimike va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Wihela fwasi yeyonda mukasi ilyo, kwakuva numbula lyako seumkeliye Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kwaifyo, hongiche unjanganifu vako na umsuke Mtwa mwene ivesa kukumbonela lusungu mahocho ga dumbula lyako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwakuva ndiwene umemile uvasi na udindilwe na sambi!”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni akahigile, “Mnisukile kwa Mtwa ago gamlongie gibihile kunihumila.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Peteli na Yohani pevamalile kuvalongela njowo cha Yesu, vakawuyile ku Yelusalemu. Pevakali vewuya vadalikile Njowo Nofu mu fijiji fya Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo ekumbatisa mkomi va Esiopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ndumindumi va Mtwa akamlongie Filipo, “Bite lubali lwa kwivindi ku ng'asi lya kukwelu yeikwika kuhuma ku Yelusalemu kwelela ku Gasa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Baho Filipo akavangile lugendo. Peagehe mung'asi vakatang'anile na munu yeafue kumagulu munu uyo akali kilongochi mkomi va kuvika finu fya Kandaki kwa ng'achale mdala va Esiopia. Munu uyu akahele ku Yelusalemu kumlumba Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Peakali iwuya kukaye kuno akang'ie muligeleti, akali ikwimba kiganulo kya mvichi va Nguluvi yeikemelwa Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muhe va Nguluvi akamlongie Filipo, “Ubite pepi lila ligeleti ulongochane nalyo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo akanyilile pepi na lila ligelete na kumpulika munu uyo ekwimba kiganulo kya mvichi va Nguluvi yeikemelwa Isaya. Filipo akamuwucha, “Ifi fyewukwimba ukuvichela?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yula munu akamhigile, “Ndewesa wuli kuchela bila munu kuniwulanicha?” Akamlongie Filipo akang'ale muligelete neke vakale pamwi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Yula munu yeafuwe kumagulu akali ekwimba masimbo aga mang'alila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Akali ngita kondolo yeisindikwa kuhinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">ngita Mwanang'ondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">peichika peidumulwa magala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">na mwene seilonga kinu kyokyonda.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Abedilwe na kuwonelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwihela yeiwesa kulonga makani gya kilelo kyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwakuva uwumi vake uhechilwe kuinyi yonda.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Yula munu akamuwuchile Filipo, “Unilongele, uyu mvichi ilonga kwa njowo chake yumwene awu kwa njowo cha vanu vangi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Baho Filipo akavangile bahala pa Masimbilo Mang'alila, akamlongie Njowo Nofu cha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Pevave mulugendo, vakafikile pono pakali na malenga, yula munu akalonga, “Pono baha kugehe na malenga, kinu liki kyekinikanila kubatiswa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo akamlongie, “Ngita udikila kwa numbula lyako lyonda wiwesa kubatiswa.” Yula munu akamhigile, “Ena, ndidikila kuva Yesu Kilisito ndi Mwana va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yula mkomi akaswitilicha lila ligeleti lime, baho Filipo na yula mkomi vakwikile, vakaingile mumalenga na Filipo akambatisa. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Pevahumile mumalenga, bahobahao Muhe va Mtwa ukamnyamule Filipo, yula mkomi seamuwene kangi, yula mkomi akaendeliye na lugendo lwake kuno ihekelela hilo.<figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8.39">Munu ibatiswa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo akawonikile kumwani lya Asoto, kumwani konda peakali ichumba akali idalika Njowo Nofu mbaka peafikile ku mwani va ku Kaisalea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ekumdikila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Magito 22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Chipindi icho, Sauli akaendeliye kuvaogopecha vadikilwa va Mtwa kwa kuvalongela ekuvadocha. Sauli akahele kwa mtekechi mkomi, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />akasuka agavilwe balua daikumgita achelilwe ukoya mu Kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi ukoya ku Damasika, neke peifikila ukoya avabate vagosi na vadala vevadikie Luchowo lwa Nguluvi na kuvapilusa ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Suwe peagehe mung'asi pepi kufikila ku Damasika, bahobaho lung'ali kuhuma kuluhano lukamng'aliche kubali chonda. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Akague panyi na akapulike lichwi yamlongie, “Sauli, Sauli! Wuli ukuniguda?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sauli akahucha, “Ndi ani veve Mtwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Mwene akamhigile, “Nene ndi Yesu yekumguda. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Suwe, wime nondee ubite kumwani ukoya kugehe na munu yekulongela kyakugita.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Vala vanu vevalongichile na Sauli vihimile bahala kuno vihela kyakuywanga, vakapulike yila lichwi ila semwene munu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli akaimile na akadindula meho gake ila seavesile kulola kyokyonda, suwe vakambate liwoko vakamlongoche mbaka kumwani ku Damasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli ikalie figono fidatu seavesile kulola na kuliya na kunyuwa kinu kyokyonda.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ukoya ku Damasika kukali na mchulila va Yesu, litawa lyake Anania. Mtwa akamlongie Anania kwa kulota njosi, “Anania!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Anania akahigile, “Ena, Mtwa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mtwa akamlongie, “Wime ubite ku ng'asi ikemeliwe, ng'asi igolwike, ukamuhuchililiche munu yumwi yeahumile Kutaliso litawa lyake Sauli. Agehe mu kaye lya Sauli nondee ekumlumba Nguluvi, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Nguluvi akamuwonisile Sauli lukani, akamwene munu yumwi yeikemelwa Anania ikwacha na kumvikila mawoko neke aveche kulola kangi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Anania akahigile, “Mtwa ndipulike njowo cha munu uyo kuhuma kwa vanu volofu, ndipulike unjanganifu yeagitile kwa vanu vako ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Mwene achile baha kwa mamlaka kuhuma kwa vatekechi vakomi, avese kuvabate vonda vevakukufunya veve.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ila Mtwa akamlongie Anania, “Ubite hela, kwakuva ndimhaguwe munu uyu anikumbanikile, alanduche litawa lyangu kwa vanu vonda seva Vayawudi na vang'achale vawo na kwa vanu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nene damuwonesa namuna peing'ang'a kugudika kwa litawa lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Anania akahele akaingile mugati, baho akamvikile mawoko Sauli, akalongie, “Mkolo vangu Sauli, Mtwa Yesu, yeakuhumie mung'asi peukali ukwacha baha, anilagiliche neke uvese kulola kangi na ulongochwe Muhe va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Bahobaho finu ngita mipalapato fikaguwe kuhuma kumeho gwa Sauli na akavesile kulola kangi, baho akawime na akabatiswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Pealie kyakuliya, ludali chake chikamuwuyile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli idalika ukoya ku Damasika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli ikalile kwa figono fidodo na vanu vevamdikie Yesu ukoya ku Damasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Bahobaho Sauli akavangile kudalika mukaye cha kufunyila Vayawudi, kuva Yesu mwana va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Vanu vonda vevampulike vakadudwive, vakilonga, “Wuli, munu uyu se yuyula yeavadochile vala vevakali vamdikie Yesu Kilisito ukoya ku Yelusalemu? Kangi achile baha akiva ing'ang'a kuvabata vanu ava na kuvasindika kwa vatekechi!” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Sauli akawongekile ludali na akavawonesa Vayawudi vevagehe Damasika, kwa kuvawonesa wachiwachi kuva Yesu ndi Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Pefipitile figono fyolofu, Vayawudi vikakung'ese na kusaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ila Sauli akachelile njowo chawo. Pumie na pamunyi Vayawudi vakumlolela mumilyangilo mikomi gya kwingilila kumwani neke vapate kumdocha. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ila pamie vanyigendwa vake vakamnyamue Sauli, vakamvikile mugati lya lindilu na kumkwisa kuchumbila libwenge lyelikali kulukanji lwa mwani.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli ewuya ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli peafikile ku Yelusalemu akageche kwiunga na vala vachulila. Ila vonda vamwogwipe kwakuva sevavesile kumwidikila kuva mwene ndi mchulila. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Balinaba akamnyamule Sauli akamsindika kwa vanjagila. Akavalongie Sauli peamwene Mtwa peakali kung'asi na Mtwa peaywangile nave. Akavalongie kangi pealanduliche litawa lya Yesu kwa ukakatima ukoya ku Damasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Sauli ekalile pamwi navo, akagendile Yelusalemu yonda na kudalika luchowo lwa Mtwa kwa ukakatima. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kangi aywangile na kulumbana na Vayawudi veviywanga Kigiliki, ila vavo vakageche kumdocha. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Vala lukolo vevamdikie Yesu pevapulike njowo icho vakamsindike Sauli ukoya Kaisalia, vakamleka ahele ku Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Chipindi icho lipinga lyelikumdikila Kilisito lyaendelie kugangamala ponda muinyi lya Yudea na Galilaya na Samalia. Na kumginya Mtwa na vakaongelike kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli akumnanicha Ainea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Peteli peakali echumba kila pono, kigono kimwi akahele kuvagendelela vanu va Nguluvi vevakali vakwikala ku Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ukoya akamwene munu yumwi yeakemelwa Ainea yeagonile pauli li kwa myaka minane kwa utamwa va lugaso. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Peteli akamlongie, “Ainea, Yesu Kilisito akunaniche. Lamuke nyengeleche kitefu kyako.” Bahobaho Ainea akalamwike. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Vanu vonda vevikwikala Lida na mulivindi lya Saloni pevamwene Ainea, navo vakamdikila Mtwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kukali na mchulila yumwinga mkidala ku mwani va Yopa yeakemelwa Tabita kwa Kigiliki ndi Dolikasi, mana lyake “Libato” Mkidala uyo akali ikigita manofu figono fyonda na kuvatanga vahangala. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Chipindi kila mkidala yula akatamike na afue, vanu vakauwogofiche mfimba gwake na vakausindike mulilingo. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yopa sepatali na mwani va Lida, vachulila pevapulike kuva Peteli agehe ku mwani va Lida, akavalagiliche vanu vavili kwa mwene, neke vamsuke, “Ache kwa vene nondee.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Peteli akahele pamwi navo. Peafikile vakasindikwe kulilingo, mumo mukali na vagane vonda vakamchungutile Peteli kuno vakivemba na kumwonesa myenda gyeahonile Dolikasi peakali wumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Peteli avahechile kwivala vonda, baho akafugamile akamsuka Nguluvi. Akailolile yila lifimba, akalongie, “Tabita wime.” Tabita akadindue meho gyake na peamlolile Peteli, akalile. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Peteli akamkolela liwoko akamnamue, pambele akavakemele vala vanu va Nguluvi na vala vagane akavagavila yula mkidala akiva wumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Njowo icho chikachelilwe ku mwani yonda lya Yopa, vanu volofu vakamdikie Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Peteli akalile figono fyolofu ukoya Yopa, akalile kwa munu yumwi yeigelanicha finu fya ngwembe, yeakemelwa Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Peteli akatang'anile na Kolineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kukali na munu yumwi ukoya Kaisalia yeakemelwa Kolineli, kilongochi va lipinga lya vapuga miya yimwi, lipinga lyelikemelwe, “Lipinga lya Italia.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Mwene pamwi na kaye lyake vakali vekumfunya Nguluvi, akali ekuvatanga vahangala na kumsuka Nguluvi figono fyonda. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Kigono kimwi saa tisa pamunyi, Nguluvi akamwonise wachiwachi, ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamwachie na kumlongela, “Kolineli!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolineli akamuhulutulile meho kwa wogofi akahuchile, “Kuna liki Mtwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi akamhigile, “Nguluvi apulike masuko gyako na usembe vako kwa vahangala, chivechile luwuwiko lya kumhechela Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nondee valagiliche vanu vahele Yopa vakamkemele munu yumwi litawa lyake Simoni, kwa litawa lingi Peteli. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Mwene nde mgenji mukaye mwa Simoni mgelanicha va finu fya ngwembe kaye igehe pepi na inyanza.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yula ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi pealongile gala akahegile, Kolineli akavakemela vanyigendwa vake vavili na mpuga yumwi yemdikie Nguluvi yeakali ekumdima Kolineli. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Akavalongie njowo chonda chechihumie, akavalagiliche vahele ku mwani va Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Kilau lyake ngita saa sita pamunyi vala vanu vadatu vakali mulugendo kuhelela ku mwani Yopa, Peteli akakang'ie pakyanya lya kaye kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Akawene njala hilo, akasakile kuliya, pevagehe kuteleka kyakula, Nguluvi akamwonise kinu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Akawene luhano chidinduliwe na kinu ngita limwenda likomi likwika panyi ikiva ihopilwe na lulegei mulupembo chake chitai. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mugati lyake kukali na vang'oko: vang'oko vevali na magulu mitai na vang'oko vevikwava na fidege fyonda fefiguluka. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Baho akampulike Nguluvi akimlongela, “Peteli lamke na hinje, uliye.” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Peteli akahigile, “Hamu, Mtwa sendiwesa kuliya kinu kinjanganifu na kyekikanilwe na Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Lichwi ikamwachile kangi ikamlongie, “Bihile kufikemela finjanganifu kuliya finu ambafyo Nguluvi afigitile filiwe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Njowo ichi chikahumile mala chidatu, pambele wula mwenda ukapyulwiswe kuluhano. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Peteli peakali adudwive kila ambakyo Nguluvi akali amwonisea mana liki, vala vanu vevalagilichwe na Kolineli, pevaichele kaye lya Simoni, vakafikile na kukwima pamlyangilo. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Vakakemela na kuwucha, vakalongile, “Wuli kugehe na mgenji yeikemelwa Simoni yeichelwa kwa litawa lya Peteli, akwikala mumu?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Peteli peave ihocha gala geawoniswe na Nguluvi, bahobaho Muhe va Nguluvi akamlongie, “Peteli! Pono baha kugehe na vanu vadatu vekusaka. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Wime na ukwike kisato kukyanya lya kaye na uwelele navo, bihile kwiwucha wucha kwakuva ndivalagiliche.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Peteli akakwikile panyi, akavalongie vanu avo, “Yekumusaka nene baha. Mwachile kugitila liki?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Vala vanu vakamhigile, “Tulagichwe na mkomi va vapuga miya yeakemeliwe Kolineli yemunu mnofu yeakumdikila Nguluvi na kuginywa na Vayawudi vonda. Mwene alongilwe na Ndumindumi Mng'alile akukemele kukaye lyake neke apulike kyokyonda kyekumlongela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Peteli akavawanuke vanu avo vaingile mugati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Pamilau lyake Peteli akavangile lugendo pamwi navo na vamonga vevemdikie Yesu va ukoya Yopa vakalongochine nave. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Kilau lyake vakafikile ku Kaisalia. Kolineli akali akuvachindila pamwi na lukolo na vaganja yeavakemele. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Peteli peakali kwingila, Kolineli akahumile kwivala akahele kumwanuka, akafugamile pautalo lyake na kugundama mbaka panyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ila Peteli akamnamule, akamlongie, “Wime, nene munu hela ngita veve.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Peteli akaendeliye kuywanga na Kolineli kuno vekwingila mugati na akavawene vanu volofu vekekung'ese. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Peteli akavalongie, “Nyenye mwichela kuva Vayawudi vakanilwe na Malagilicho lya dini lyawo, kukala na munu va inyi yingi awu kutangana. Ila Nguluvi anichelise ndibihile kumukemela munu yeyonda kuva seidikilwa na Nguluvi awu mnjanangifu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Kwa ifyo, pemunikemelie sendikanile kwacha. Suwe ndikuvahucha, wuli mnikemelie?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koloneli akahigile, “Ngita figono fitai fyefichumbile, muda ngita ugu saa tisa pamunyi, ndikali kufunya mukyumba kyangu, bahobaho munu yeafwalile myenda mivalafu pee, akaimile palutalo lyangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Akalongie, Koloneli, kufunya kwako na usembe vako chehumiche kwa vahangala chidikilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Valagiliche vanu ku mwani va Yopa akamukemele munu yumwi akemeliwe Simoni, kwa litawa lingi ikemelwa Peteli, agehe mukaye mwa Simoni yeigelanicha finu fya ngwembe, yikala pepi na inyanza. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Bahobaho ndivalagiche vanu kwa veve, nave ugitile unofu kwacha. Suwe nefwe vonda tugehe kulutalo lwa Nguluvi kugapulika gyonda Mtwa gyeakuswitiche wache kutulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli akuvadalikila vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Baho Peteli akavangile kulonga, “Ndakyene Nguluvi ihela umwilila. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Munu va inyi lyolyonda yeakumwidikila Nguluvi na kugita gegali manofu, daidikilwa na mwene. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nyenye mwichela kuva Nguluvi avalagiche vanu vake, kuvadalikila vanu Vaisilaeli Njowo Nofu kuva vapate utengamaso kwa kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Nyenye mwichela njowo chechihumie ku inyi lyonda lya Yudea kuvangila ku Galilaya Yohani peamalile kuvadalikila vanu unanzi vake va ubatiso. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mwichela fila Nguluvi peamuhagule Yesu va Nasaleti, kwa kumgavila Muhe va Nguluvi na umwimike. Mwene akahele kuno na kuno akigita manofu na kuvananicha vanu vevakali vagudiswe na Setani, kwakuva Nguluvi akali pamwi nave. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Nefwe ndi vanu yetulolile kwa meho gyetu njowo chonda yeagitile ku inyi lya Vayawudi na ku Yelusalemu. Vakamdochile kwa kumkong'olela mukipindilihicho. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ila Nguluvi amchulubuche kigono kya udatu, akamgita awonike, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Seawonike kwa vanu wonda, ila kwa nefwe tuhaguliwe na Nguluvi kuva vanu vetulolile kwa meho gyetu, yetulie na kunyuwa nave peachulubuke kwa mwene. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Yeatuswitiliche kudalika Njowo Nofu kwa vanu vonda na kulandulicha kuva mwene nde yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi aveche mswitilicha vavali wumi na vevafuwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Vavichi vonda va Nguluvi vakaywangile njowo chake kuva kila munu daikumwidikia ambonilwa lusungu sambi chake chonda kwa litawa lyake.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolineli na lukolo vake vakumwanuka Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Chipindi Peteli peave iywanga njowo icho, Muhe va Nguluvi akavakwikile vanu vonda vevakali vipulika njowo icho. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Vala Vayawudi vevadikie, vevaachile pamwi na Peteli kuhuma Yopa vakadudwive kulola kuva Nguluvi avakavile fupo lya Muhe va Nguluvi vanu seva Vayawudi, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />kwakuva vekavapulike vakilonga kwa luga yingi, vakimnjuma Nguluvi. Baho Peteli akalongie, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Vanu ava vamwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi ngita nefwe petumwanuke. Ani yeiwesa kuvakanila vanu ava vabihile kubatiswa kwa malenga?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Kwaifyo, akaswitiliche vabatiswe kwa litawa lya Yesu kilisito. Baho vakamsuka Peteli asigale navo kwa figono fidodo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Peteli akuvahumulila Vayawudi njowo cha Kolinelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Vanjagila na vevamdikie Yesu yevakalile ku Yudea vakapulike kuva vanu se Vayawudi validikie luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ndeni, Peteli akawuyile ku Yelusalemu, vanu vevamdikie Kilisito vevakali vadumulwe bina vakamupinjile Peteli vakilonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Veve ukahele kwikala na vanu sevadumulwe bina na ukaliye navo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Baho Peteli akavanga kuvalongie wachiwachi kila kinu kyekihumie kuhuma pamwandi.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Akalongie, “Kigono kimwi pendikali ku mwani Yopa pendifunya, Nguluvi akandiwonise njowo wachiwachi, kinu ngita mgololo mkomi ikwika panyi kuhuma kuluhano ikiva ibatilwe mulupembo chake chita, ikavikilwe pepi na nene. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ndikang'omelela mugati kwa unofu ndikawene, vang'oko vonda vevali na magulu mitai na vang'oko vevikwava na fidege fya kululanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Baho ndikapulike lichwi yikundongela, ‘Peteli namuke, hinje, uliye.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ila nene ndikalongie, ‘Hamu Mtwa! Sendiwesa kuliya kinu kinjanganifu na kyekikanilwe na Nguluvi na seking'ang'ilwe kulilwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ila lichwi yapulise kangi kuhuma kuluhano, ‘Bihile kufikemela fihofu kuliya finu ambafyo Nguluvi afigitile filiwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Njowo ichi ikahumile mala chidatu na pambele yila mgololo ikawuyile kangi kuluhano. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Bahobaho vanu vadatu vevakali valagilichwe kwa nene kuhuma Kaisalia vakahimile pakaye yendikali ndikwikala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muhe va Nguluvi andongile ndihele na vene ndibihele kwiwuchahucha. Ava lukolo sita vakalongochine na nene kuhelela ku Kaisalia na ukoya tukaingie mukaye mwa Kolineli. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kolineli akatulongie akali awene ndumindumi va Nguluvi peihimile mukaye lyake na kumlongela, ‘Uvalagiliche vanu ku mwani va Yopa, vakamkemele Simoni yeichelwa kwa litawa lya Peteli. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Mwene dakulongela njowo chechikuwokola veve na kaye lyako lyonda.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Pendivangile hela kulonga, Muhe va Nguluvi ukavakwikila ngita peatubwitukie nefwe pamwandi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Baho ndikawiwuke njowo chealongile Mtwa, ‘Yohani akabatise kwa malenga na nyenye mwibatiswa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Suwe, ikiva Nguluvi avagavile fupo vanu se Vayawudi ngita yiyila yeatugavile nefwe petumdikie Yesu Kilisito, nondee nene ndi ani mbaka ndigeche kumpinja Nguluvi?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pevapulike ago, vakalekile kumpinja Peteli, vakamnjuma Nguluvi, vilonga, “Nguluvi avagavile vanu se Vayawudi fwasi lya kuhongecha sambi chawo neke vapatile uwumi va mbepali!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya vanu vevakumdikia Kilisito ukoya ku Anitokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Vala yevayanganike kuhumana na magudo gegahumile kwa kufua kwa Setefano vala vadikila vevayaganike vangi vakahele kutali mbaka Foinike na Kipilo na Anitiokia, vakidalika njowo cha Yesu kwa Vayawudi hela. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ila vamonga vadikila vevahumile ku Kipilo na Kilene, navo vakahele Anitiokia vakavadalikie vanu se Vayawudi njowo cha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Nguluvi akavatangile na vanu volofu vakamdikila na kumsedukila Mtwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Njowo icho cha vanu avo chikafikile kwa vanu vevemdikile Kilisto ukoya Yelusalemu, navo vakamlagicha Balinaba ahele ku Anitiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Balinaba peafikile na kuwona Nguluvi peavafunyile kwa vanu avo, akakedukile hilo na kuvalongela vagangamale vaendelise kumnjuma Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba akali munu mnofu na alongochilwe na Muhe va Nguluvi na akamdikie Nguluvi, lipinga likomi lya vanu likakwegilwe kwa Mtwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Pambele Balinaba akahele ku Taliso kumsaka Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Peampatile Sauli, akamsindike Anitiokia. Navo vonda vavili vekalile na vanu vevamdikie Kilisito kwa mwaka wumwi na kuwawulanicha vanu volofu. Ukoya Anitiokia ndi vachulila vakavangile kukemelwa Vakilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Chipindi icho vamonga vavichi va Nguluvi yevahumile ku Yelusalemu, vakafikile Anitiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Yumwi vawo, litawa lyake Agabo, ahimile na kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi, akalagule kuva daihumila lumyai ngomi ku inyi yonda ambacho Valumi vitavala. Lumyai ulo yahumie chipindi cha ng'achale Kilaudio. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Vala vachulila, vakalamue kila munu kwa uwimike vake, asindike kyokyonda neke kuvatanga vala vanu vevamdikie Yesu, yevakalile inyi lya Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Suwe, vakagitile ifyo na vakavalagiliche Balinaba na Sauli, vasindike kwa vagogolo va lipinga lya vanu vevamdikie Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo idochwa na Peteli ivikwa mukihopo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Chipindi chilachila, Ng'achale Helode akavabatile vanu vamonga yevamdikie Yesu Kilisito na kuvagudisa. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Akamdochile Yakobo, mkolo vake Yohani kwa lipanga. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Peawene Vayawudi vakeliwe na kila kyeagitile, akaendeliye, akambate Peteli. Lichowo ulo lukagitilwe chipindi cha lihungu lya mibumunda seivikilwe lisimika. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Peteli peabatilwe akavikilwe mukihopo, panyi lya vadima va fipinga fitai fya vapuga vatai vatai. Helode akasakile peichumba Pasaka amuhumiche Peteli palutalo lya vanu neke amuhige nongwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Peteli peakali mukihopo, vanu vevamdikie Yesu, vakali vikumsukia kwa Nguluvi kwa lengo limwi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli iwokolewa kuhuma mukihopo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Payave kufikila kigono kyeasakile Helode, kumuhumicha Peteli palutalo lya vanu, pamie Pateli avasile pagatigati lya vapuga vavili, akiva ahopilwe milegei gya kyuma givili, kuno vapuga vakali vidima mlyangilo mkomi va kihopo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bahobaho ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi akahumie na welu ukang'alika mgati lya kihopo. Yula ndumindumi va Nguluvi akamuhogosile Peteli mubafu na kumlandamusa, akalongie, “Wime kisatu!” Bahobaho chila ndegei gya kyuma chechihopilwe mumawoko chikague. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamlongie, “Fwale myenda gyako na makobasi gyako.” Peteli akagitile ifyo. Baho akamlongie, “Uyiwope mwenda vako na unifwate.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Peteli akamfwatile ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi na kuhuma kwivala mukihopo. Seachele gyegihuma gakali ndakyene awu Nguluvi akumwonesa kinu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Peteli na ndumindumi uyo va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vakachumbile kwa vadima vevakali vidima mulyangilo va kwanja na va pili, vakafikile mumlyangilo va kyuma va kuhumila mukiwopo na vakwingilila ku mwani. Ugo mlyangilo ukadundwike uwene, navo vakahumile kwivala. Pevakali vigenda ng'asi yimwi na bahobaho ndumindumi uyo va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamlekile Peteli weka hela.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Baho Peteli peachele gyegihumile akalongie, “Nondee ndichela ndakyene kuva Mtwa amlagiliche ndumindumi vake va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, anihumiche mumawoko gya Helode na kuhuma mu njowo chonda chevahochile Vayawudi gihumile.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Peachele ifyo akahele kukaye lya Maliya, maye va Yohani litawa lyake lingi Maliko. Vanu volofu vakali vekekung'esile mula kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Peteli akakong'ola mlyangilo va kwivala na mnyigendwa yumwi muhinja yekemelwa Loda, akahele pamumlangilo kumpulikicha. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Uyo mhinja peachele lichwi lya Peteli, akahekelela hilo, akawuyile kuno seadinduwe mlyangilo na kuvalongela kuva, “Peteli agehe pa mlyangilo!” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Vakamlongie yula mhinja, “Una lukwale!” Ila mwene akaendeliye kulonga kuva ndakyene. Nawo vakamlongie, “Uyo ndi ndumindumi vake kuhuma kukyanya kwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Peteli akali ahendeliye kung'ola mlyangilo. Pambele vakadindue mlyango vakamwene, pevamwene vakadudwive hilo. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Peteli akagolise liwoko lwake neke vachikile chii, akavalongie wuliwuli Mtwa peamuhumiche mukihopo, “Baho akavalongie kuva mlonge njowo ichi kwa Yakobo na vadikila vangi.” Baho akahuma akahele pono yingi. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Pekukie, kukahumie wogofi mkomi pagati lya vapuga kutigila gegampatile Peteli. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode akaswitiliche vamsake kila pono, ila sevawese kumubata. Akavawuchile vala vapuga sevawesile kumhiga unofu, baho akaswitiliche vahechwe pono pa udimo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Baho Helode akahumile Yudeya na kuhelela kwikala ku Kaisiliya.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufua kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ng'achale Helode avipilichwe hilo na vanu va inyi lya Tilo na Sidoni, ifyo vanu va inyi lya Tilo na Sidoni ndi vanu va mwani iyo vakiungene kuhelela kuywanga nave, vakaswitilicha Bulasito yeakali munu va pepi na mwimilicha va finu fya ng'achale aveche pamwi navo. Baho vakamweleliye ng'achale Helode kumsuka kuveche na lutengamaso mugati lyao, kwakuva vanu va mwani igo vakwipatila kyakula kuhuma ku inyi lya ng'achale uyo.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Kigono kimwi kyekihaguliwe, Helode akiva afwalile myenda gyake gya ung'achale na kwikala pakigoda kya ng'achale, akavadalikila vanu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Vala vanu vakalongile kwa lichwi likomi, “Iyi ndi lichwi lya Nguluvi na se lya munu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Bahobaho ndumindumi va kuluhano akamgwisa panyi Helode kwakuva seamgavile Nguluvi wula unjuma. Fikoko fikamliye, akafua.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Luchowo lya Nguluvi likaginile na kulutala.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balinaba na Sauli pevamalile yila kasi yevahele kuigita, vakawuyile ku Yelusalemu vakiva pamwi na Yohani litawa lyake lingi Maliko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli vihaguliwa na kulagilichwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mugati yevamdikie Yesu ukoya Anitiokia na kukali na vavichi va Nguluvi na vawulanichi, pagati lyao kukali na Balinaba na Simoni yeachelinike kwa litawa lya, munu mtitu na Lukio yeahumile Kulene na Sauli na Manaeli yealeliwe pamwi na ng'achale Helode. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Pevakali vakimsuka Mtwa na kwikala bila kuliya, Muhe va Nguluvi akalongie, “Munihaguliye Balinaba na Sauli vagite kasi yila yendivakemeliye.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Pevamalile kwikala bila kuliya na kumlumba Nguluvi, vakavavikila mawoko na vakavalaga vahele.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Paulo vidalika ukoya Kupulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Balinaba na Sauli pevalagilichwe na Muhe va Nguluvi, vakahele mu inyi lya Seleukiya na kuhuma ukoya vakachumbile mu inyanza kwa wato mbaka kigunguli kya Kupilo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Pevafikile ku mwani lwa Salami vakadalika luchowo lwa Nguluvi mu kaye cha kutang'anila Vayawudi, vakali pamwi na Yohani litawa lingi Maliko, akali ngita mtanga vawo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Vakagendile mu inyi yonda lya kupulo, vakafikile ku mwani wumwi weukemelwa Pafo. Ukoya vakamwene Myawudi yumwi muhavi yeikemelwa Baliyesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Munu uyu akali mganja va Segiyu Paulo mkomi va lila kigunguli, akali munu munya luhala lukomi. Mwene akavakemele Balinaba na Sauli, akasakile kupulikicha luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ila Baliyesu muhavi ambaye kwa Kigiliki akameliwe Elima, akagechile kuvapinja Balinaba na Sauli neke amtaniliche yula mkomi va kigunguli abihile kumdikila Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Suwe, Sauli litawa lingi ikemelwa Paulo, akiva ilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, akamfulutulie meho yula muhavi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />na akalongie, “Veve mwana va Setani! Veve ndi mchundwama va kyokyonda kila kyekigehe kinofu na uendeliye kuseducha undakyene va Mtwa kuva udesi! Seuleka ng'asi cha Mtwa chechigolike. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nondee uwimike va Mtwa daukutova, dauvecha bofwike meho na ubihile kuliwona lichuwa kwa kigono kidodo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bahobaho meho gya Elima gingie kisi na akachungutilechukutile na kumsaka munu va kumbata liwoko na amlongoche. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yula mkomi va kingunguli, peagawonile ago, akamdikie Mtwa kwakuva akadudwichwe na mawulanicho gya Mtwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Paulo vihelela ukoya Anitokiya lya Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Baho Paulo na vayage vakaagama kwa wato kuhuma Pafo, kuhelela Peliga, mwani va Pamfuliya, ila Yohani litawa lingi Maliko, akavalekile na akawuyile ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ila vawo vakaendeliye na lugendo kuhuma Peliga mbaka ku mwani va Anitiokia inyi lya Pisidiya. Kigono kya kutulula vakahele mukaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, vakakalile. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Peikwimbilwe suwe kiganilo kya Malagilicho gya Musa na masimbilo gya vavichi va Nguluvi, vakomi va lila kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, akalagiliche unanzi kwa Paulo na Balinaba, vakalongie, “Valongu, ngita mugehe na luchowo nofu lwa kuvalongela vanu ava, mlonge.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Baho Paulo akahimile, akapungile liwoko vachike, akalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">nyenye Vaisilaeli veyangu na nyenye se Vayawudi ambawo mukupulikicha Nguluvi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nguluvi va vanu va Isilaeli, akavahague vagogolo vetu na akavagita kuva inyi ngomi pevakali vekwikala kuhenja ku inyi lya Misili, kwa umwimike vake akavahumiche ukoya ku Misili na kuvalongocha. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Avalelile kwa myaka alobaini kukwelu, hata ngita figono fyonda vakali sevakumwidikila. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Mwene akahang'anise inyi saba lya Kanaani na akavagavila vavo inyi ilyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ago gyonda gakagitilwe kwa myaka miya chitai na amsini, pegachumbile ago, “Nguluvi akavagavila vaswitilicha neke vavalongoche mbaka chipindi cha Samweli mvichi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Baho vanu vakasukile vagavilwe ng'achale, Nguluvi akavagavile Sauli, mwana va Kishi va kabila lya Benjamini, yeavalongoche kwa myaka alobaini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nguluvi peamuhechile Sauli akamuhague Dawudi kuva ng'achale vao. Nguluvi akamlongie, ‘Ndimwene Dawudi mwana va Yese, munu yeaukelise numbula lyangu, daagita fyonda fyendikela afigite.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kuhumila na ulelo va munu uyu, Nguluvi avaletie Mkombosi vanu va Isilaeli yende Yesu. Ngita pealongie. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Chipindi Yesu seavangile kugita kasi lyake, Yohani akavadalikile vanu vonda Vaisilaeli kuva vahongiche sambi chawo na kubatiswa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohani peagehe pepi kumalila kasi lyake lya kubatisa, akalongie, ‘Nyenye mwichela nene ani? Nene seyula yemukumchindila. Uyo daikwacha kumbele lyangu. Nene sendidikilwa kuwopola lulegei cha makombasi gyake.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Ulelo vangu, vana va Ibulahimu na vanu se Vayawudi yemwimdikie Nguluvi! Unanzi ugu va uwokofu ufikile kwa nyenye. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwakuva vevikwikala ku Yelusalemu na vilongochi vawo sevamchele vala kuchela njowo cha vavichi va Nguluvi pegikwimbilwa kila kigono kya Kutulula, ila vakagatimisile gala masimbililo kwa kumdocha Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ingava sevapatile nongwa lya kumuhiga, vakamsukile Pilato aswitiliche adochwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Pevasindile kugita fyonda fyefisimbilwe kumtigila Yesu, wakamkwisile kuhuma pakipindilihicho na vakamsile. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ila Nguluvi amchulubuche. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Kwa figono fyolofu, akavahumie vala vevakali pamwi navo kuvangila ku Galilaya mbaka ku Yelusalemu. Avo ndi vevakali valolile na kuvalongela vanu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Nefwe twachile baha kuvaletela Njowo Nofu, luchowo lula, Nguluvi lyeavalagine vagogolo vetu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nguluvi gatimisile gala gyeavalongie vagogolo vetu, kwa kumchubucha Yesu, ngita peisimbilwe mu kiganulo kya Sabuli kya pili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Veve ndi Mwana vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">nene neng'uli ndivechile Daada vako.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kwakuva Nguluvi amchulubuche abihile kuwuya ukoya na kuwola, Nguluvi akalongie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ndakyene ndikukugavila veve lufunyo lwangu lwendimlagine Dawudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ngita pendilongie pono kungi mukiganilo kya Sabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Sedakumleka mnyigendwa vako mnofu awole.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Ila Dawudi peamalile kugita gyealongilwe na Nguluvi kwa vanu vachipindi kyake, akafue na kusilwa pepi na vagogolo vake na lifimba lyake ukawola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ila yula yeachulubuchwe na Nguluvi, mu ngombwe akuwola hamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Kwa ifyo lukolo vangu Vaisilaeli, ndisaka nyenye mchele kuva kuchumbila uyu Yesu, unanzi va kulekelwa sambi, ulandulichwa kwa nyenye, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na kila munu yeakumdikila Yesu, ihechelwa sambi chonda, luchowo ambalyo seliwesekana kwa ng'asi lya malagilicho. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Kwa ifyo muyilolise neke gala gyevalongie vavichi va Nguluvi gibihile kuvahumila.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Vavichi va Nguluvi vakalongie, ‘Mwilolele, nyenye vabeda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">mdudwive na kufuwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwakuva kyendigita neng'uli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">sedamwidikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata ngita munu akivahumulila.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulo na Balinaba pevakali vihuma kwivala lya kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, vala vanu vakavasuka wachile kangi kigono kya Kutulula kyekikwacha, avawulaniche kangi njowo icho. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Vanu pevayaginile, Vayawudi volofu na vangi se Vayaudi yevadikile dini lya Vayawudi, vakavafuatila Paulo na Balinaba. Avo vanjagila Paulo na Balinaba vakavalongie, vaendeliye kwikala mu usanzi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Kigono kya Kutulula kyekifuatile, pepi vanu vonda va mwani wula vakaachile kupulikicha luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ila Vayawudi pevawonile lila lipinga likomi lya vanu, vakamemile wifu na kulonga njowo cha kumpinja Paulo na kumliga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Baho Paulo na Balinaba vakavahigile kwa ukakatima, vakilonga, “tukang'ang'ilwe kuywanga luchowo lwa Nguluvi na nyenye tandi. Ila kwakuva mulikanile na mwiyigile nyenye vavene kuva semwikela kwikala mbepali, nondee tukuvaleka tuhelela kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwakuva Mtwa atulagilichile ndeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ndikugitile veve kuva welu kwa vanu se Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">neke vanu vonda va inyi yonda, vawokoliwe.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Vanu se Vayawudi pevapulikile njowo ichi vakahekelela na kulinjuma luchowo lwa Mtwa na vala vonda vevakali vahaguliwe kupata uwumi va mbepali, vakadikie.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Luchowo lwa Nguluvi likalutala mu pono pala ponda. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ila Vayawudi vakavayovela vadala va uginyange se Vayawudi vevakali vakuifwata dini lya Uyawudi, na kangi vakavayovelela vakomi va mwani ula. Navo vakavayovelela vanu kuva vavagudise Paulo na Balinaba, vakavadaga kuhuma mu inyi lyao. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ifyo Paulo na Balinaba vakapumuna mafune ku magulu gyawo neke kuvapinja, baho vakahele Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ila vachulila vakakedukile hilo na vakamemile Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba ukoya ku Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ukoya Ikonio Paulo na Balinaba vakaingile mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi ngita pevihongile. Ukoya vakadalika kwa ukakatima mkomi mbaka Vayawudi na vanu va inyi yingi vakamdikie Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ila vala Vayawudi yevakanile kudikila, vakavayovela vanu se Vayawudi vavapinje avo vadikila. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ifyo Paulo na Balinaba vakakalile ukoya kwa figono fyolofu vakidalika kwa ukakatima njowo cha Mtwa, nave Mtwa akavachelise usanzi vake, kwa kuvagavila umwimike va kugita kimanyilo na umunyitu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ila vanu va mwami ugo vakagawanikile, vangi vakwiwungile na Vayawudi na vangi vakwiwungile na vanjagila.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Vamonga lya vanu se Vayawudi na Vayawudi vakwiwungile na vamonga lya filongochi, vakagitile mupango va kuvagitila vanjagila unjanganifu na kuvatova maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Vanjagila pevachele njowo icho, vakanyiliye ku Lisitila na Delibi ku kumwani va Likaoniya na pono cha pepi, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />ukoya vakaendeliye kudalika Njowo Nofu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba ukoya ku Lisitila na Delibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Kukali na munu yumwi ukoya ku Lisitila yeakali mtenda kuhuma kubabwa na akali sewesile kugenda haa. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Munu uyu ampulikiche Paulo peakali akidalika. Paulo akamlolile akamwene analyo mbatwa lya kunanichwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Paulo akalongile kwa lichwi likomi, “Wime kwa magulu gyako!” Bahobaho yula munu akahimile kisato, akavangile kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lila lipinga lya vanu pevalolile gyeagitile Paulo, vakabwatike kwa luga lya Kilikaoniya, vakalonga, “Valungulu vevagehe ngita mivili gya vanu gitukwikile!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Vakamkemela Balinaba Seu na Paulo vakamkemela Helimesi, kwakuva Paulo akali kilongochi mkomi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mtekechi va kaye lya nguluvi Seu, lyelikali kwivala lya mwani, akasindika ng'ambako na malembecho gya uluva palutalo lya mlyango mkomi va ku mwani, mwene na lipinga lya vala vanu vakasakile kuvahechela usembe lya kunyanya vala vanjagila. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ila vanjagila Paulo na Balinaba pevapulike njowo icho, vakademula myenda gyawo na kunyilila mu lipinga lya vanu, vakabwatike, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Nyenye vanu wuli mwigita njowo ichi? Nefwe ndi vanu ngita nyenye hela. Tuvaletile Njowo Nofu, neke muchileke kufifunya fing'omong'omo na msedukile Nguluvi yeagehe uwumi, yeawumbile luhano na inyi na inyanza na fyonda fyefigehe. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Pamwandi Nguluvi akavalekile vanu se Vayawudi vendelee kugita gala gevikela. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ila Nguluvi sealekile kuvawonisa mwene poyuli kwa kuvagitila manofu, kuvaletele ndonya kuhuma kuluhano neke muveche na mabenelo kwa chipindi chake, avagavile kyakula fyolofu na kuvamemicha ukeduka munumbula lyenu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Vanjagila vakawesile kulikanila lila lipinga libihele kuvahechela usembe ila seikali upefu kuvakanila kwa machowo gyawo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Baho vamonga lya Vayawudi yevahumile Anitiokia na Ikonio, vakavagita vanu vaveche pamwi navo. Vakamtova Paulo kwa maganga, vakamkwega mbaka kwivala lya mwani, vakahochile afue. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ila vadikila pevakekung'esile na kumchungutila, Paulo akalamwike na kuwuya ku mwani. Kigono kyekifuatile Paulo na Balinaba vakahele Delibi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba viwuyila Anitokiya inyi lya Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulo na Balinaba vakadalike Njowo Nofu mu mwani lwa Delibi na kuvagita volofu vamdikie Yesu. Baho vakawuyile ku mwani lwa Lisitila na Ikonio na Anitiokia inyi lya Siliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Vavagitile vachulila vakale unofu na kuvasuka vakale muudikilo. Vakavalongie, “Twing'ang'wa kuchumbila mu magudo gyolofu, neke twingile mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Vakahaguwe vavaha kuhuma mu kila lipinga lya vanu yevamdikie Kilisito pevamalile kumlumba Nguluvi na kwikala bila kuliya neke kuvavika panyi lya ulongochi va Nguluvi vevamdikie.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Baho vakachumbile mu inyi lya Pisidiya, vakafikile ku mwani lya Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Pevamalile kudalika wula unanza ukoya ku mwani va Peliga, vakahele ku inyi lya Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kuhuma ukoya vakang'ie wato vakawuyile mwani va Anitiokia, pono ambako pamwandi vakali vakavafunyile kwa kasi lya Nguluvi ambalyo nondee vakali vaimalile.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Pevafikile Anitokiya vakavakemela vevamdikie Nguluvi pamwi, vakamlongie gala Nguluvi gyeagitile pamwi navo na file kuvatanga vanu se Vayawudi vamdikie Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Vakakalile pamwi na vala vevimdikie Yesu kwa figono fyolofu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Lidamo likomi ukoya ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Vanu vamonga kuhuma inyi lya Yudeya vakahele ku mwani va Anitokiya, navo vakali vakuvawulanicha vala vevamdikie Kilisito vakilonga, “Ngita semdumulwe bina kuhumila na Malagilicho gya Musa, semuwesa kuwokoliwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulo na Balinaba pevapulike lukani ulo vakakanile kuvadikila, kukahumile na malimbano makomi, vakahaguliwe Paulo na Balinaba pamwi na vanu vamonga lipinga lya vevamdikie Kilisito va Anitiokia vahele ku Yelusalemu kwa vanjagila na vagogolo neke vakaywange njowo icho.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Suwe, vala vanu vevamdikie Kilisito va Anitiokia vakavalagiliche Paulo na vayage, pevakali mu ng'asi vakachumbiliye ku Foiniki na Samaliya vakavahumulile vanu wuliwuli vanu se Vayawudi pevamwimdikie Kilisito. Njowo chila chikavakedusile hilo vanu vonda vevamdikie Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Pevafikile ku Yelusalemu vakawanukwe na vanu vevamdikie Yesu na vanjagila pamwi na vagogolo, baho Paulo na Balinaba vakavahumulile finu fyonda Nguluvi fyeagitile pamwi navo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Baho vanu vamonga vevamdikie Yesu va lipinga lya Mafalisayo vakahimile na kulonga, “Avo vanu se Vayawudi ving'ang'wa vadumulwe bina na vawulanichwe kufwata Malagilicho gya Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Vanjagila na vagogolo vakatang'anile pamwi neke valikagule lukani ulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Pevaywangile hilo, Peteli akawime na kulonga, “Lukolo vangu, mwichela kuva kigono kya kwanja Nguluvi akanihaguwe kuhuma kwa nyenye kulanducha Njowo cha Yesu kwa vanu se Vayawudi vachipulike na kudikila njowo cha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nave Nguluvi, yeichela numbula cha vanu, akawonise kuva ekuvakela kwa kuvagavila Muhe va Nguluvi ngita fila peatugavile nefwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nguluvi seagitile umwilila wowonda pagiti lyetu na wene. Ila akavahechela sambi chawo, kwakuva vamdikie Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nondee, wuli mwisaka kumgecha Nguluvi kwa kuvababicha vanu vevamdikie Yesu misigo misito ambagyo hata vagogolo vetu, vala nefwe setuwesa kugibaba? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Hamu, ila nefwe, ngita wene twidikila kuva twiokoliwa kwa usanzi lwa Mtwa Yesu Kilisito.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Lipinga lyonda lisigale jii, vakavapulikiche Paulo na Balinaba vakihumulila wuliwuli Nguluvi peavatange kugita fimanyilo na umanyitu kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pevamalile kuywanga, Yakobo akalongie, “Lukolo vangu, munipulikiche! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni atuhumulile wuliwuli Nguluvi kwa mala lya kwanja peyiwonise kwa vanu se Vayawudi na kuyihaguliya vanu vamonga vaveche vanu vake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Njowo ichi chiwana hilo na njowo cha vavichi va Nguluvi, ngita pegisimbilwe mu Masimbo ga Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Mtwa ilonga ndehe, ‘Pegichumba njowo ichi, ndiwuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuchenga kangi kaye lya Dawudi yeiguwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Dandichenga kangi mahame gyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kwimicha unofu,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />baho vanu vangi vonda davikwacha kwa nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">na vanu vonda se Vayawudi yendivakemele vaveche va nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">davakumsaka Mtwa,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />ilonga Mtwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">yeagitile njowo ichi, chichelilwe kuhuma daha.’”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Baho, Yakobo akaendeliye kulonga, “Uswitilicho vangu nde ugu tubihile kuvagudisa vanu se Vayawudi yevamsedukila Nguluvi kwa kuvalongela vafwate machovelo gyetu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ila tuvasimbiliye baluwa kuva vabihile kuliya finu fyefihechilwe usembe na kugitwa sevidikilwa mukumfunyila Nguluvi na valeke ugoni na vabihile kuliya vang'oko vevanyongilwe na kunyuwa danda. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwakuva chipindi chitali Malagilicho gya Musa gakali gidalikwa ku mwani yonda na kukwimbilwa mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi gyonda kila kigono kya Kutulula.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa kwa vanu se Vayawudi vevamdikie Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Vanjagila na vagogolo pamwi na vavu vonda vevamdikie Yesu va Yelusalemu, vakaswitiliche kuvahagula vanu vamonga vawo kuvalagilicha ku Anitiokia pamwi na Paulo na Balinaba. Vakavahagule vanu vavili Yuda yeikemelwa Balisaba na Sila, yevakali vichelenika na vevamdikie Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />na vakavalagilicha na vakavagavila baluwa yeilonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Nefwe vanjagila na vavaha na lukolo vetu, tukuvahungila nyenye vanu se Vayawudi vevamdikie Yesu kuhuma ku Anitiokia na inyi lya Siliya na inyi lya Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tupulike kuva vanu vamonga kuhuma kwa nefwe vakavasumbule kwa njowo chechikuvagudicha. Ila nefwe setuvalagiliche! <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ifyo tuswitiliche kwa pamwi kuvahagula vanu vamonga na kuvalagilicha kwa nyenye, pamwi na vakelwa vetu Balinaba na Paulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />vene vakali hata kuyaganicha uwumi vawo, kwakuva lya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kwa ifyo, tukuvalagicha Yuda na Sila, vene davavalongela ifi fyetusimbile. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kwakuva imkeliye Muhe va Nguluvi nefwe tubihile kuvabebecha misigo gyogyonda kugina kwa makani aga geging'ang'wa kugitwa, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />mbihile kuliya finu fyefihechelwe usembe kwa valungulu na mbihile kunyuwa danda na mbihile kuliya huchi lya mwang'oko yeaniyongilwe na mleke ugoni. Damuvecha mgitile unofu pemuchileka njowo ichi. Mkale unofu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ifyo vakalagilwe, vala vanjagila vakahele ku Anitiokia. Vakavakung'ese pamwi vanu vonda vevamdikie Yesu na vakavagavila yila baluwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Pevamalile kwimba yila baluwa, njowo chila chikavafaliji, vakakedukile hilo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila, navo vakali vavichi va Nguluvi, vakaywangile navo kwa chipindi chitali njowo chongofu cha kuvafaliji na kuvatanga vanu vevamdikie Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Pevakalile ukoya kwa chipindi chidodo, vala vanu va Anitiokia vevamdikie Yesu vakavalagile kwa lutengamaso, baho vakawuyile kwa vala yevavalagiliche. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ila Sila akawonile ngiba asigale ukoya.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ila Paulo na Balinaba vakasigale ukoya ku Anitiokia, vakavawulanicha na kudalika luchowo lwa Mtwa, pamwi na vanu vangi volofu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba vekulekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Pafigono fidodo, Paulo akamlongie Balinaba, “Tuwuye tukavagendelele vala vanu vevamdikie Yesu kwa kila mwani petudalikige luchowo lwa Mtwa, tulole viendelea wuliwuli kumnjuma Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balinaba akasakile valongochane na Yohani, yeachelinike kwa litawa lya Maliko, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />ila Paulo seakelile kulongochana na Maliko kwakuva akawayile kuvaleka pevakali ukoya ku Pamifilia na akakanile kuendeliya kugita kasi navo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Suwe, pakahumile na malimbano pagati lya Paulo na Balinaba mbaka vakalekana ng'asi. Balinaba akalongochane na Maliko vakang'ie wato, vakahele Kupilo, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />ila Paulo akamuhaguwe Sila vakahegile, baada lya vala vanu vevamdikie Yesu kuvang'ang'ila usanzi va Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Paulo akachumbile ku inyi lya Siliya na Kilikiya na kufikangamalisa fipinga fya vanu vevamdikie Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timotewo akwiyunga na Paulo na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo akafikile ku Delibi na Lisitila, kukali na mchulila yumwi yeakemelwa Timotewo. Maye vake akali Myawudi, yeamdikie Yesu, ila daada vake akali Mugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timotewo akanjumilwe na vanu vonda vevamdikie Yesu ukoya Lisitila na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo akasakile Timotewo alongochane nave, ifyo akamnyamule na kumdumula bina. Paulo agitile ndena, kwakuva Timotewo achelinike na Vayawudi vonda vevikwikala pono pala kuva daada vake akali Mugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pevakali vechumba pa kila mwani valivagavila vanu vevamdikie Kilisito malagilicho yegalongilwe na vanjagila na vavaha vala vevamdikie Kilisito va ukoya ku Yelusalemu, vakavalongie mugakolele. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ifyo vanu vevamdikie Yesu vakali vakakatima mu mbatwa na lipinga lya vanu lyahongilike kila kigono.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluvi akumwonesa Paulo kinu ukoya Makedoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paulo pamwi na vayage vakachumbile ku mwani va Fulugiya na ku Galatia, vakali vakanilwe na Muhe va Nguluvi vabihile kudalila luchowo lwa Nguluvi mu inyi lya Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Pevagehe pepi Misiya, vakagechile kwingila ku mwani va Betania, ila Muhe va Yesu akavakanile kubita. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Baho vakachumbie ku Misiya, vakakwikiliye ku mwani va Tiloya. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Pamie Nguluvi akamwonise Paulo munu ukoya Makedoniya ahimile na kumsuka, akilonga, “Chabuke, wache Makedoniya wututange!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paulo peamuwonile kila kyewonisilwe na Nguluvi, tukayandalise kwa lugendo, tukiva tumdikie Nguluvi katukemile ukoya Makedoniya kudalika Njowo Nofu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya ekumdikila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kuhuma Tiloya, tukakang'ie wato mbaka ku inyi lya Samotilaki, pakilau lyake tukafikile ku mwani va Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kuhuma ukoya, tukahele mbaka ku Filipi, mwani mkomi va Makedoniya, inyi yeikali panyi lya utavala va Valumi, nefwe tukakalile baho kwa figono fyolofu. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Kigono kya Kutulula tukahele kwivala lya mwani mung'umbu lya mgoka, tukahochile twipata pono lya kumsuka Nguluvi. Twikalile, tukaywangile na vadala vekung'esile pono bahala. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Kukali na mdala yumwi yeamdikie Nguluvi, yeikemelwa Lidiya, mwenekaye va mwani Tiatiliya. Mwene akali igucha myenda kwa sendi ngomi, Mtwa akamdinduwe numbula lyake, agawanuke gala geakali ilonga Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Suwe peabatiswe mwene na vanu va mukaye lyake, akatuwanuke mukaye mwake akilonga, “Ngita muwene ndakyene nene ndimdikie Mtwa, mwache mkale mukaye lyangu.” Akatuyovelela hilo tuhelele kukaye lyake.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila vivikwa mukihopo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Kigono kimwi, petukali twihelela pono pa kufunyila, mhinja yumwi yeali na lihoka munya ludali cha kulagula akatang'ane na nefwe. Mhinja uyo avagitile vakomi vake vapate umosi kwa kasi lyake lya kulagula. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Baho mhinja amfwatile Paulo na nefwe, kuno ibwatuka na kulonga, “Vanu ava ndi vanyigendwa va Nguluvi yeagehe Kukyanya Hilo. Vakuvalanduchila ng'asi lya uwokosi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Akali egita ifyo kwa figono fyolofu hata kigono kimwi Paulo akavipile na kumsedukila na kumlongela uyo lihoka, “Ndikuswitilicha kwa litawa lya Yesu Kilisito, muhume munu uyu!” Bahobaho lihoka akamhumile. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Vamosi va yula mhinja pevawene kuva sevawesa kangi kwipatila sendi, vakavabatile Paulo na Sila vakavakwega mbaka ku soko, pautalo lya vahiga va mwani. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Pevavasindikile palutalo lya vahiga nongwa vakavalata vakilonga, “Vanu ava vileta ndewo ku mwani lyetu, na vene ndi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Vewulanicha malagilicho kwa nefwe Valumi setukuchidikila vala kuchifwata.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Lipinga lyeligehe pala lyaunganile kumtova Paulo na Sila na vala vahiga nongwa vakavafule myenda gyao kwa ludali, vakavaswitilicha vatovwe ndomondo. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pevatovilwe hilo, vakavavika mu kihopo na kumlagilicha mkomi va vapuga avadime unofu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kuhumila na malagilicho ago, yula mdima va kihopo akavavikile mukyumba kya mugati hilo na magulu gyawo gikahopilwe mumibiki mikomi.<figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16.24">Vanu vavili vawopilwe magulu gyao palibiki likomi</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Pepi na mulogati, Paulo na Sila vakali vakimlumba Nguluvi na kwimba lusambo lwa kumnjuma Nguluvi, kuno vadindwa vangi vakiva vapulikicha. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bahobaho pakahumile litetemeko likomi lya mganga, hata msingi va kihopo ukahogosike. Baho milyangilo gyonda gikadinduke na minyololo gyevawopilwe chikadundwike. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Yula mdima va kihopo, pealamke na kulola milyangilo gya mukihopo gidundwike, akahomola lipanga lyake akasakile kwidocha, akahochile kuva vasutu vonda vanyilile. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Paulo akabwatile akalongie, “Bihile kwidocha, nefwe vonda tugehe baha.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yula mdima va kihopo, akalagiliche agavilwe lwenge, akaingile mugati kya kyumba, akafugamile kuno itetema, palutalo lya Paulo na Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Baho akavahumiche kwivala akilonga, “Vatwa vangu, ndigite liki neke ndipatile kwokoka?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Vakamhigile, “Mwidikile Mtwa Yesu nave wiwokolewa pamwi na lukololo vako vonda.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Vakamdalikie luchowo lwa Mtwa mwene pamwi na vanu vangi va mu kaye lyake. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Pamie wulawula yula mdima va kihopo akavanyamula, akavawogofecha fikong'o fyawo. Bahobaho akabatiswa mwene pamwi na vayage vonda yevakali mu kaye lyake. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Baho vakavasindika Paulo na Sila mu kaye lyake, vakavagavila kyakulia. Mwene na lukolo vake vonda vakagitile lihungu kwakuva vakali vamwidikie Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Pamilau lyake, vala vahiga nongwa vakavalagilicha vanyigendwa vawo kwa mdima va kihopo, akilonga, “Muvaleke vanu avo vahege.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Yula mdima va kihopo akamlongie Paulo, “Vahiga nongwa, vatulagilicha kuva tuvaleke muhege. Nondee mwiwesa kuhuma na kuhelela kwa mbatwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ila Paulo akamhigile, “Ingava setukagitile nongwa lyolyonde, vakatutovile ndomondo pawelu kwa vanu, baho vakatuvikile mukihopo, kwakuva nefwe ndi vanu va Loma, nondee vikela kutuhecha kwa lupwepo! Hamu, ving'wang'wa vene vache baha kutuhecha.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Vala vadima va kihopo vakavalongie chila njowo vahiga nongwa na pevapulike kuva Paulo na Sila ndi vanu va Loma vakogwipe hilo. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ifyo vakahele kuhongecha na vakavahumicha mukihopo na kuvasuka vahege mu mwani wula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Baho Paulo na Sila pevahumile mukiwopo, vakahele mu kaye lya Lidia. Ukoya vakatang'anile na Vakilisito na vakavagangamisa, baho vakahega.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo na Sila ukoya ku Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulo na Sila mulugendo lwawo vakachumbile ku Amfipoli na Apolonia na vakafikile ku Tesolonike, ambako kukali na kaye lya Kufunyila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulo ngita peachovie, akaingile mu kaye lya Kufunyila Vayawudi, mufigono fya Kutulula fyefilongachine, akaywanga navo kwa kutumila Masimbo ga Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Akaywangile na kuwonesa kuva ing'wang'wa Kilisito agudwe na baho achulubuke, akalonga, “Uyu Yesu yendikuvalongela ndi Kilisito.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Vayawudi vamonga vamdikie Yesu na kwiwunga na Paulo na Sila, filafila na Vagiliki yevamwidikie Nguluvi na vadala volofu vene ludali na vilongochi vakomi navo vamdikile Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ila Vayawudi vangi vevakali sevamdikie Kilisito vakawonile wifu, vakahele musoko, ambawo vakavakung'ese vanu volofu, navo vakavangile kugita ndewo ku mwani. Vakahele vakaingie kwa ludali mu kaye lya Yasoni vakivasaka Paulo na Sila, neke vavasindike ku mwani va vanu Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ila sevakavawene vakavakwega Yasoni na lukololo vangi pautalo lya vahiga nogwa va ku mwani, vakabwatwike, “Vanu ava nde vala yevaseduche inyi lyonda na vachile kuno, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni avawanuke mukaye lyake. Vonda sevadikile malagilicho gya mkomi va ku Loma, vakalonga, ‘Agehe ng'achale yungi yeakemelwa Yesu.’” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Pevapulike ago vakavaogofiche vahiga nogwa va mwani na vanu vevapulike. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Vakavalongela Yasoni na vayage vahombe kyokyonda cheching'ang'ilwa, pevahombile, vakavaleka vahele.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila ukoya ku Beleya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Pamie peufikile, vanu vevamdike Yesu vakavasindika Paulo na Sila ukoya ku Beleya. Pevafikile ukoya vakahele mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Vanu va ukoya vakali vakumpulikicha Nguluvi kuvagina vala va ukoya ku Tesalonike. Avo vanu va Beleya vakawanuke wula unanzi na kugakwimba na kugaganula masimbo ga Nguluvi kila kigono, neke kulola ngita gegalongilwe na Paulo gakali ndakyene. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Vayawudi volofu vakamdikile Yesu pamwi na vadala vene ludali va Kigiliki na vagosi va Kigiliki vakamdikile Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ila Vayawudi va Tesoloniki pevachele kuva Paulo akali idalika luchowo lwa Nguluvi ukoya Beleya, vakahele ukoya na kugayovelecha mapinga gya vanu vagite ndewo. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Vala lukolo vakamsindike Paulo mung'umbung'umbu lya inyanza ila Sila na Timotewo vakasigie Beleya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Vala vanu vakamsindike Paulo mbaka Atene. Baho vawuyile na malagicho kuhuma kwa Paulo kuva Sila na Timotewo vamfwate kisatu hilo.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo eywanga na vanu va Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulo peakali akuvachindila Sila na Timotewo ukoya Atene, akavipile hilo peawene mwani ugo umemile ming'omong'omo gya valungulu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ifyo vakaywangile na Vayawudi na vanu vangi vevamdikile Nguluvi mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, kila kigono akali eywanga na vanu yevakali itang'ana navo pono pasoko. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vamonga vevafwatile mawulanicho ga Epikulo na Sitoiki, vakalimbine nave.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Vangi vakalongie, “Elonga liki uyu ndwangamlomo?” Vangi vakalongie, “Iwonika elonga njowo cha valungulu va vagenji.” Vakalongie ndeni kwakuva Paulo akali akidalika Njowo cha Yesu na kuchulubuka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Vakamnyamule Paulo na kumsindika ku ludamo lya kuchela lya kutang'anila Aleopagu, vakalongie, “Wuli twiwesa kuchela mana ga mawulanicho aga gamiya geukugatuwulanicha. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Finu fyolofu fyetupulike mumasigicha getu fiwonekana kuva filuilui kwa nefwe. Twikela kuchela njowo ichi china na mana liki.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Vanu va Atene na vagenji vonda vevikalile ukoya vakali vakutumila chipindi chawo chonda kuhumulila na kupulika njowo miya.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Baho Paulo akaimile pautalo lya ludamo lwa Aleopagu akalongie, nyenye vanu va Atene! Ndikuvalola kuva kwa kila luchowo nyenye nde vanu yemwing'ang'a hilo kumfunya Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwakuva pendikali ndichumba kuno na kuno ndikawene ming'omong'omo gyenu gya kufunyila, ndikawene pono yimwi lya kufunyila isimbilwe, kwa Nguluvi Yeseachelanike. Suwe, uyo yemkumfunya bila kumchela, nde ndikumdalika kwa nyenye. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nguluvi yeaumbile inyi na fyonda fyefigehe, ndi Mtwa va kuluhano na inyi, mwene seakwikala mu kaye lya kufunyila lelichengilwe na vanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Vala seitumikilwa kwa mawoko gya vanu, kuhocha kuva mwene ekela kyokyonda kila, kwakuva mwene nde akuvagavila vanu wumi na muhe na kuvagavila kila kinu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kuhuma kwa munu yumwi yeavagitile vanu va inyi chonda, neke vakale mu inyi yonda. Aswitiliche kuhuma daha pandili na kwiya vanu va inyi icho davakale. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nguluvi agitile ifyo, neke vanu va inyi ilyo veveche kumfwatila hata kwa kumbyalisa pangi vampate. Ila Nguluvi seagehe patali na kila yumwi vetu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ngita yealongile munu yumwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">mugati lyake mwene twikwikala, twigenda na kuvecha na wumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">ngita saili pelilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">efwe nde vana vake.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Kwakuva nefwe ndi vana va Nguluvi, setutakilwa kuhocha kuva Unguluvi vake uwana na ling'omong'omo lyelihongilwe kwa sahabu awu lya fesa awu lya liganga lihongwile. Igyo ming'omong'omo ihongilwe kwa luhala lwa vanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Nguluvi akagitile ngita seilola kipindi kila kya vanu vevakali vapufi, ila nondee akuvalagicha vanu vonda kila pono valeke sambi na vamsedukile Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwakuva avikile suwe kigono ambakyo akuvahinga vanu va inyi lyonda kuchumbila munu yumwi yeamuhague. Nguluvi avawonisile vanu vonda lukani ulu kwa kumchulumbucha munu uyo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Vangi pevapulike Paulo akiywanga njowo cha uchulubuko, vanu vamonga vakambedile, ila vangi vakalongie, “Twikela kupulika kangi njowo ichi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Paulo akavaleka, akahuma mu ludamo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Vanu vamonga viwungile na Paulo na vakamdikila Yesu mugati lyawo akali Dionisio mnanzi va ludamo lya Aleopago, kangi kukali na mdala yumwi yeakemeliwe Damali na vanu vamonga.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulo ukoya ku Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Pambele, Paulo akahumile Atene na akahelele Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ukoya Kolinto, amwene Myawudi yumwi ikemelwa Akula, mubabilwa va Ponito. Akula pamwi na mdala vake yeakemelwa Pilisila, vakali vawuyile kuhuma ku Italia figono fidodo fyefichumbile kwakuva ng'achale Kilaudio akali avaswitiliche Vayawudi vonda vahume ku Loma. Paulo akahele kuvalola, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na kwakuva vonda vakali vahona kyama ngita mwene, Paulo akalile navo na kugita kasi pamwi navo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila Kigono kya Kutulula Paulo akali eywanga na vanu mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi akagechile kuvakwega Vayawudi na Vagiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timotewo pevafikile kuhuma inyi lya Mekadonia, Paulo akatumile chipindi chake chonda kwa kudalika, akivalongela Vayawudi kuva Yesu nde Kilisito Mkombosi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ila Vayawudi vakavanga kwipinjana na kumliga Paulo, akapumune myenda gyake pautalo lyawo akalongie, “Ngita muyagila manyi mwavene, nene ndihela nongwa lyolyonda mu njowo ichi. Kuvangila neng'uli ndikuvahelelea vanu se Vayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Baho akahegile na kwikala mu kaye lya munu yumwi yeseakali Myawudi akumdikila Nguluvi yeakemelilwe Tito Yusito, kaye lyake ikali pepi na kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo, mkomi va kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, akamwidkila Mtwa pamwi na lukolo vake vonda. Vakolinto volofu vakapulikiche njowo icho vakamdikile Kilisito na kubatiswa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Kigono kimwi pamie, Paulo akawoniswe kinu na Mtwa akamlongie, “Bihile kwogopa, endeliye kudalika vala bihile kuchika, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwakuva nene ndigehe pamwi na veve. Kwihela munu daagecha kukulemacha kwakuva mu mwani ugu vagehe vanu volofu vevikunidikila.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Suwe, Paulo akakalile ukoya kwa chipindi cha mwaka umwi na myechi sita akiwulanicha luchowo lwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Chipindi Galio peagehe mkomi va mwani va Akaya, Vayawudi vevakali ukoya pamwi vakambatile Paulo, vakamsendike ku ludamo lwa vahiga. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Vakalongie, “Tukumlata munu uyu kwakuva kavawulanicha vanu neke vamnjume Nguluvi bila kufwata malagilicho ga Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulo peahave seavangile kulonga, Galio akavalongie Vayawudi, “Mpulikiche nyenye Vayawudi, ngita mukumlata munu uyu kwakuva lya unjanganifu awu kwakuva lya uwofu ngandi wesile kuvapulikicha. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ila ngita ndi njowo cha kulumbana kutigila njowo cha malagilicho gyenu, muswitiliche mwavene. Nene ndilema kuva mhiga va njowo icho!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Baho, akavadagile kuhuma mu ludamo lwa kuhiga. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Vene vonda vakambata Sositenesi mkomi va kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, vakamtovile bahala pautalo lya ludamo lya kuhiga. Ila Galio akafiwene njowo icho se kinu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ewuya ku Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulo akalile Kolinto kwa figono fyolofu. Baho avalagile vanu vevadikila Yesu, akakang'ie wato kuhelela Siliya pamwi na Pilisila na Akula. Pevafikile Kenikilea Paulo amogile fwili chake kutimisa lyagano lyeamlongie Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Vakafikile Efeso na baho Paulo akavalekile Pilisikila na Akula, akahele mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi na akali iywangana na Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Vakamsukile akale navo kwa chipindi chitali, ila Paulo akavakanile. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ila peakali ihega, akavalongie, “Nguluvi akikela ndikwacha kangi kwa nyenye,” Akahegile kwa wato mbaka ku Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Peafikile ku Kayisalia, Paulo ahelile ku Yelusalemu kuvahungila lipinga lya vanu vevamdikie Kilisto, baho akawuyile akahele ku Anitiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Akalile ukoya kwa chipindi chidodo, akahuma ukoya na kuchumbila mu mwani chingi cha ku Galatia na Fulugia kuvagangamacha vadikila vonda.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo idalika Efeso na Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Myawudi yumwi yeakemelwa Apolo, mubabwa va Alekisandilia, akafikile Efeso. Akali munu mwene kuywanga unofu na mwene akali ichela unofu Masimbo ga Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Akali awulanichwe njowo cha Mtwa, kwakuva akali na lukelo munumbula lyake, aywagile unofu njowo cha Yesu, hata ngita akali ichela ubatiso va Yohani weka hela. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apolo atalile kuywanga kwa ukakatima mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi, ila Pilisila na Akula pevapulike vakamkemele mukaye lyawo vakamuwulanicha unofu hilo njowo cha Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo pealamuwe kuhelela ku pono lya Akaya, vanu va Efeso vevamdikie Yesu vakamgangamache na vakavasimbile baluwa neke vamwanuke ukoya pono lya Akaya, peagehe ukoya akali mtangwa hilo kwa vanu ambawo kuhumila na usanzi va Nguluvi vakali vamdikie Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kwa umwimike mkomi, akavalakilile Vayawudi yevakali vipinja pawelu, akiwonesa kwa Masimbo ga Nguluvi kuva Yesu nde Mkombosi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulo idalika ukoya ku Ifeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Chipindi Apolo peakali Kolinto, Paulo akagenda mu lya Asiya na akafikile Ifeso ukoya akavawene vachulila vamonga, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />na akavahucha, “Wuli, pemwidikie Kilisito, mukawanuke Muhe va Nguluvi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Vakahigile, “Hamu, hata setupulike kuva kugehe na Muhe va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Baho Paulo akavahucha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">“Ubatiso liki mubatichwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Vakamhigile, “Ubatiso va Yohani.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulo akalongie, “Yohani akali akuvabatisa vanu kuwonesa kuva vanu vahongechile sambi, akali akuvalongela vanu vamwidikie ambaye daikwacha kumbele lyake, nde Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pevapulike ago, vakabatiswe kwa litawa lya Mtwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulo akavavikie mawoko kukyanya gya mituwe gyawo vanu vala na Muhe va Nguluvi akavaikile, vakavavangile kulonga kwa kiluga kihenja na kulonga njowo ambacho Nguluvi daigita. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Vanu vevakali bahala vakali vagosi chumi na vavili.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulo akaingie mukaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi na kulonga kwa ukakatima kwa chipindi cha myechi chidatu, akali iywanga na vanu neke avakwege vadikile Ung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ila vanu vomonga vakali vasugu, vakakanile kudikila, vakavangile kuliga unanzi vake pautalo lya vanu yevakung'esile. Baho Paulo akavaleka, akavanyamule vachulila vake na kuywanga nawo kila kigono mulidamo lya mawulanicha lya munu yumwi yeikemelwa Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Makani ago gikaendeleya chipindi cha miyaka givili, hata Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi venekaye va Asia, vakawesile kulipulika luchowo lwa Mtwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana va Sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nguluvi akagitile umanyitu mikomi kuchumbila Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Hata fitambala na mwenda gwegimubyalise Paulo vikavikilwe kukyanya lya vatamwa, nawo vakananile matamwa gyawo na mahoka vakavahuma. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ila Vayawudi vamonga vene kuyuvanjuva kuno na kuno vidaga mahoka vigecha kutumila litawa lya Mtwa Yesu kwa kugalongela mahoka, “Ndikuvaswitilicha muhege kwa litawa lya Yesu, yula yeidalikwa na Paulo.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Vangi vevakali vigita ndeni vakali vana vakigosi saba va Sikewa, yeakali kilongochi va vatekechi va Kiyawudi.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ila kigono kimwi, lihoka likavalongela vana va Sikewa, “Ndikumchela Yesu na ndikumchela Paulo, ila nyenye va ani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Baho yula munu yeakali na lihoka akavang'etukila na akavaginile ludali na kuvatova hilo. Na vana va Sikewa vakanyila kuhuma kwivala lya yila kaye ufula na kuno valemichwe muvili. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kila munu ukoya Ifeso, Myawudi na se Myawudi, akapulike lukani hulo. Vonda vingie na wogofi, vakalinjuma litawa lya Mtwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Vanu volofu vevamdikie Yesu vakahumile pawelu na vakahongecha kuleka kugita mawofu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Vamonga vevakali vagitile uhavi pamwindi, vakasindike figanilo fyao na kufinyanya lyoto pautalo lya vanu. Pevavalile galama hilo lya figanulo fyefinyanyilwe lyoto fikali fipande fya madini fya fesa elufu amusini. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ifyo luchowo lwa Mtwa lwaginile kulutala konda na kuva na ludali hilo.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndewo ukoya Ifeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pechichumbile njowo icho, Paulo akalamuwe kuhelela ku Yelusalemu kwa kuchumbila ku Makadoniya na ku Akaya. Peakali mung'asi ilongile munumbula lyake, “Pendifika ukoya, dandihela ku Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ifyo akavalagicha vatanga vake vavili, Timotewo na Ilasito, vamlongole kuhelela ku Makedoniya na mwene akasigalie ku Asia kwa chipindi chidodo.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Chipindi icho kukahumile ndewo ngomi ukoya Ifeso kwakuva lya ng'asi yila lya Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ndewo ugo ikavangichwe na munu mvatula feza yeakemelwe Demetilio, yeakali ihongola ling'omung'omu lya feza cha kaye lya nguluvi mukidala yeakemeliwe Alitemi. Kasi ilyo ikavagavile mafundi vake sendi chongofu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetilio akavakung'ese pamwi na vanu vangi yevagitile kasi ngita mwene na akavalongie, “Nyenye vanu, mwichela kuva umosi vetu uhuma mukasi iyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Nondee, mukulola na kupulikicha yunye njowo chechigeta Paulo, se Ifeso hela, ila na Asia ponda. Mwene kavayovelecha na vakuvalongela kuva valungulu gegigalanichwe na vanu se valungulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kasi ichi daivecha na litawa lihofu. Se ifyo hela, Ila luchowo hulo liwesa kugitwa mukaye lya nguluvi Alitemi na daibedwa. Pambele njuma chake uyu nguluvi mkidala chechikali ku Asia konda na muinyi yonda, dachisila.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Pevapulike ago, vakavipile hilo na vakavanga kubwatika, “Alitemi va ku Ifeso ndi Mkomi!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Baho mwani wonda ukamemile ndewo. Vakavabata Gayo na Alisitaliko, venekaye va Makedoniya, vevakali mulugendo pamwi na Paulo, vakanyila nawo mbaka kivanja kya kukinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo akasakile kwingila mugati lya lipinga lya vanu, ila vachulila va Mtwa vakamkanile. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Vakomi vangi va pono lya Asia, vevakali vaganja vake Paulo, vakavalagiliche vanu vamsindikile unanzi va kumkanila Paulo kuva abihile kwingila mukivanja kya kukinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ndipo vanu yevakung'ese bahala vakayaganike hilo. Vakabwatile vakilonga vangi ili na vangi lila, vangi sevachele kwaliki vatang'anile. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Vayawudi vakamsung'iliche Alekisanda pautalo lya vanu, vamonga va vanu mulipinga lila vakamlongie ga kulonga. Baho Alekisanda akahumicha kimanyilo kwa liwoko kuva vachike alonge ga kwitasa pautalo lya lipinga lya vanu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ila pevachelege kuva mwene nde Myawudi, vonda vakabwatuke kwa lichwi limwi kwa chipindi cha saa chivili, vakilonga “Alitemi va Ifeso ndi mkomi!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kalani va mwani akauchikiliche lila lipinga lya vanu na kuvalongela, “Nyenye vanu va Ifeso, kwihela yeseichela kuva mwani va Ifeso nde wivika kale lya Alitemi mkomi na ila ling'omong'omo lyake yeiguwe kuhuma kuluhano? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kwihela yeiwesa kupinja njowo ichi. Ifyo vonda mchike mbihile kugita kinu kyokyonda kisatu. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muvalete baha ava vanu, navo sevahichile kyokyonda mukaye lya nguluvi vala kumliga uyu nguluvi vetu mkidala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ifyo, Demetilio na vayage vagehe na malato pakyanya lwa vanu ava, ving'ang'wa kuvalata pautalo lya vahiga nongwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ila ngita mgehe na njowo chingi msindike pa ludamo lyelitakilwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Tugehe muunjanganifu va kulatwa kuhumila na ndewo cha neng'uli, twihela njowo lyolyonda lya kugita ndewo ugu, na setuwesa kuvalonga njowo nofu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Peasindile kulonga ago akavalongie vanu vahege.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulo akahele kangi ku Makedoniya na Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ndewo chila pechisilile ukoya Ifeso, Paulo alivakemelie pamwi vala vadikila, akavalagile na akahele ku Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Peakali ichumbila mu inyi chila akali akuvagangamisa mbaka peafikile ku Ugiliki. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ekalile ukoya kwa chipindi cha myechi midatu. Peakali ikwiandala kuhelela ku Siliya kwa ng'asi lya inyanza, akachele kuva Vayawudi vakali vang'ang'a kumgitila mwofu, ifyo akalamuwe kuwuya kwa kuchumbila ku Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Paulo akali afwatine na Sopatu mwana va Pilu, kuhuma Beleya na Alisitaliko na Sekundo kuhuma Tesoloniki na Gayo munu va Delibe na Timotewo pamwi na Tukiko na Tilofimo vevihuma Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Vanu ava vakatulongue na vakatuchindila Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Peichumbile lihungu lya mibumunda yeseivikilwe lisimika, nefwe tukakang'ala wato kuhuma Filipi na pefichumbile figono fidatu tukafikile ukoya Tiloa. Ukoya tukakalile kwa chipindi cha figono saba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvagendelela kangi vadikila va Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mukigino kya kwanja kya wiki tukatang'anile kuliya kyakulia. Paulo akaywangile na vanu mubaka mwilogati, kwakuva asakile kuhega kilau yake. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Mu kyumba kya lilingo kwetukali tutang'anila kukali na lwenge fyolofu hilo. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mdimi yumwi litawa kyake Yutiko, akali ekalile pa lidilisa chipindi Pauli ekwendelela kudalika. Yutiko avangile kusinjila molemole mbaka avasile tulo akaguwe panyi kuhuma mulilinga lya udatu. Pevamuholile vakamwene afuwe suwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paulo peikile panyi, akangundamile na kumkumbatila yula mdimi, akalongie “Mbihile kwogopa, kwakuva mdimi ndi wumi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Baho Paulo akakang'ie kangi mulilingo, akalie kyakuliya, endelie kudalika chipindi kitali mbaka nyolasagala, baho akahegile. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Vanu vamkamsindike yula mdimi mbaka kukaye lyake akiva wumi, navo vakagangamalichwe hilo.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ihelela ku Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Nefwe tukakang'ala wato kulongola kuhelela ku Aso, neke tukatang'ane na Paulo, atulongie tugite ndeni kwa kuva mwene akali ihelela ukoya kwa magulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Baho, akatuwene kula Aso, tukamkang'ase muwato, tukahelela Mituleni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kuhuma kula tugagedile na tukafikile Kio pamilau lyake. Kigono kya uvili tukahagama kwelela kukigunguli kya Samo na kilau lyake tukafikile Melito. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo akali alamuwe kwendelela na lugendo kwa wato bila kuchumbila Ifeso neke abihile kwikala hilo koya Asia. Akali na kisatu lya kufika Yelusalemu kwa lihungu lya Pendekosite ngita peiwesekane.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvalaga vagogolo va ku Ifeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Paulo peali ku Melito, akalagiche unanzi ukoya Ifeso kwa vagogolo va Kanisa wache kutang'ana navo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Pevafikile akavalongie, mwichele wuliwuli petukalile na nyenye figono fyonda kuhuma kigono kya kwanja penifikile ku Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mwichela pendemgumbanikie Mtwa kwa unyenyekefu gonda, kwa mihochi na utatala gendigapatile kuhumila na uwofu va Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mwichela kuva sendisitile kuvadalikila pawelu na ku mukaye chenu na kuvawulanicha kyokyonda ambakyo kyekuvatanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ndikavakanie Vayawudi wonda, pamwi na vanu va se Vayawudi, vamsedukile Nguluvi na kumwidikila Mtwa vetu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Nondee, Muhe va Nguluvi akunilongocha kuhelela ku Yelusalemu bila kuchela ndeliki kyekindihumila ukoya. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Kinu kimwi chendichela Muhe va Nguluvi akundongela undakyane kuva kila mwani wendichumba fiwopo na magudo vikunichindila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ila hata ngita ndifuwa se kinu kwa nene, kinu kikomi kwa nene ndisindiliche ula unjagila vangu na yila kasi yeanigavile Mtwa Yesu ndigite, ende ndilonge Njowo Nofu lya usanzi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Nichumbile kuno na kuno kwa kila vanu vonda ndikidalika ung'achale va Nguluvi. Ila ndichela kwihela hata yumwi venu daakunilola kangi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Kwa ifyo ndikuvalongelela neng'uli kuva ngita peiyaga munu yumwi venu, nene ndihela nongwa yoyonda. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwakuva sendikanile kuvalongela gala ambago Nguluvi akugakela. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mwidime nyenye vene na mulidime lila lipinga lyonda ambalyo Muhe va Nguluvi avavikile nyenye kuva vadima vake. Muvagavile kyakula lipinga lya vanu vevamdikie Kilisito, ambalyo Nguluvi avapatile kwa danda lya Mwana vake. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndichela kuva pendihega nene, vawulanichi va udesi davikwacha kwa nyenye, davivecha ngita mikeve na dasevawonela lusungu lipinga lya vachulila va Mtwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hata kuhumila pagati lyenu, vehumila vanu ambawo velonga njowo cha udesi neke kuvachanga vanu na kuvagita vavadikile vene. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ifyo mwidime! Mkichela kuva kwa muda va miaka midatu, pamie na pamunyi, sendichokile kuvakanila kila yumwinga venu kwa mihochi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nondee, ndikuvavika mumawoko gya Nguluvi na luchowo lyake lyeligehe na usanzi vake, ambalyo ligehe na ludali lwa kuvagangamicha na kuvagavila uhala ambawo avavikile nyenye pamwi na vanu vake vangi vonda. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nene sendikadobokile sendi vala sahabu vala myenda gya munu yoyonda. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Nyenye mwichela kuva mawoko gyangu igi igumbanikile kwa finu fyangu na veyangu vala vevakali pamwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mufyonda fyendikitile ndikali ndikuvalolesa kuva twing'ang'wa kugita kasi ng'angafu nefwe, neke tuveche kuvatanga wevagehe na sida, chipindi petugitile ndeni tuveche twikwihuka njowo ambacho Mtwa Yesu yumwene akalongile, “Ngiba kutawula kuchumba kwanuka.”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulo peamalile kuloga akafugamile pamwi navo akamlumba Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Vonda vakavembile, vakamlaga kwa kumbatila Paulo na kumnonela. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Kyekivasugwimiche hilo ni kwa gala njowo chealongile kuva sevakumlola kangi uso vake. Wakahele nave mbaka mu wato.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulo ihelela ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Petulagine navo, tukakang'ie wato kukahela mbaka ku Kosi. Kilau lyake tukafikile ku Lodi na kuhuma ukoya tukahele ku Palata. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ukoya tukauwene wato yeuhelela ku Foiniki, tukakang'ie na kuhega. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Petufikile pono petukali tukawesile kuwona kigunguli kya Kupilo, tukachumbile lubali lwa kwivindi kwelela Silia. Petufikile ku mwani va Tilo tukaimile vakwisile michigo gyegikali muwato. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ukoya tuvawene vanu vevamdikie Yesu, tukakalile pamwi navo kwa figono saba. Vadikila avo vakali viywanga kwa ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi, vakamlongie Paulo ubihile kuhelela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ila chipindi chetu pekifikile tukahegile. Vonda pamwi na vadala na vana vawo tukehelela pamwi mbaka kwivala lya mwani, tukafungamile mung'umbung'umbu lya inyanza tukamlumba Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Petulaganile navo, tukakang'ie muwato, vene vawuyile kukaye chawo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Baho tukaendelie na lugendo kuhuma ku Tilo mbaka ku Tolemai ukoya tukavahungila vanu vevamdikie Yesu na tukakalile navo kwa kigono kimwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Pamilau lyake tukahegile kuhelela ku Kayisalia. Ukoya tukahele mukaye lya Filipo mdalika wa Njowo cha Nguluvi. Mwene akali yumwi va vala saba yevahaguliwe ukoya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Akali na vahinja vatai ambawo vakali na umwimike va kulonga njowo cheilonga Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Petukalile ukoya figono fidodo, mvichi yumwi yeakemeliwe Agabo afikile kuhuma ku inyi Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Peatufikile akanyamuwe lufunga lya Paulo, akajiwopile mawoko na magulu, akalongie, “Muhe va Nguluvi elonga ende, ‘Vayawudi va ku Yulasalemu vakumuwopa ndena munu munya lufunga ulu na kumsindika kwa vanu se Vayawudi.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Petupulike njowo ichi nefwe na lukololo vangi tukamsukile abihile kuhelela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ila Paulo akahigile, “Mwisaka kulonga liki? Muli mwivemba na kutenya numbula? Ndiandalise suwe se hela kuvikwa mukiwopo ukoya Yelusalemu, ila hata kufwa kwa kuva lya Mtwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Petulemwile kumswitilicha neke abihile kuhelele tukachikile, tukalonga hela, “Cheikele Mtwa kigitwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Petukalile baha kwa figono, twawopile michigo gyetu, tugaendelela na lugendo kupita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Vamonga va vala vachulila mwani va Kayisalia vakahele pamwi na nefwe, vakatusindika mu kaye lya munu yeakemeliwe Mnasoni ambalye tukakalile kwa mwene kwa chipindi. Mnasoni uyo akali munya kaye va Kupilo na akali mchulila va figono fyolofu.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ekumgendelela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Petufikile ku Yulasalemu, lukolo vevamdikie Kilisito vakatwanuke unofu hilo. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Pamilau lyake Paulo akahelele pamwi na nefwe kumhungila Yakobo na vavaha vonda va lipinga vevamdikie Kilisito vakali baha. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Petuvahugie, Paulo akavangile kuvalongela luchowo lumwi hadi lungi ambacho Nguluvi akagitile kwa vanu se Vayawudi kwa ng'asi lya mnyigedwa vake. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Pevapulike ago, vakamjumile Nguluvi. Baho vakamlongie Paulo, “Lukolo vetu wilola kugehe na Vayawudi vevimwidikie Yesu na vonda vakakolele malagicho gya Musa kwa unofu. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Vakapulike kuva ukivawulanicha Vayawudi vonda vevikwikala mu inyi lya vanu se Vayawudi, kuva vabihile kukolela malagicho ga Musa kuvadumula bina vana vawo vala kufwata machovelelo gya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nondee tugite liki? Ndakyene davipulika kuva wachile ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Kwa ifyo gite ngita petukukulongela. Kugehe na vanu vatai baha vihopile vavene kuva vakumgavila Nguluvi kinu. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Uhelele navo kulufunyo lya kuwofoga na uvahombe fila fyevatumie fyonda neke vamoge fwili chawo. Neke kila munu achele kuva kwihela undakyene pakyanya lya njowo chonda chechilongwa bali wikwikala kwa kugaginya malagicho gya Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ila vala vanu se Vayawudi vevakali vadikila, tuvasindikie suwe balua tukivalongela njowo yeulamuwe, Mbihile kuliya chochonda kyekitambikilwe kwa valungu va udesi, mbihile kunyuwa danda mbihile kuliya huchi lya mung'oko yeafue mwene na mtane ugoni.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Baho, pamilau lyake Paulo akavanyamue vala vanu vatai na kugitila lufunyo lya kwiwofogecha pamwi nawo. Baho akaingie mu kaye lya kufunyila neke avalongele njowo lya figono fyefimalila kwiwofoga na kigono kya kuhecha usembe lya kila yumwinga vao.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ibwata mukaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Figono ifyo saba pefikali pepi kusilila, Vayawudi vevakali vahumile ku mwani va ku Asia vakamwene Paulo ku kaye lya Nguluvi. Baho vakavaswitiliche vanu vonda na vakambatile Paulo kwa ukakatima. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Vakabwatile, “Nyenye vanu va Isilaeli, mututange! Mwene nde munu yeichumba kila pono na kuvawulanicha vanu vonda, njowo chechikuvakana Vaisilaeli, malagicho gya Musa na pono baha pang'alile. Nondee avaingiche vanu se Vayawudi ku kaye lya Nguluvi na kwananga pono baha pang'alile.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Valongile ifyo nde kuva vakali vamwene Tilofimu, munu va Ifeso, akali pamwi na Paulo ku mwani, vakachele kuva Paulo akali amuyingiche ku kaye lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mwani vonda ukamema ndewo, vanu kuhuma lubali lyonda, vakambatile Paulo, vakamukwega, vakamuhumicha kwivala lya ku kaye lya Nguluvi na baho milyangilo lya kaye lya Nguluvi idindilwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Chipindi vanu avo veng'ang'a kumdocha, njowo chawo chikamfikie mkomi va vapuga va ku Loma kuva mwani vonda va Yelusalemu kugehe mundewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Baho mkomi va vapuga avanyamue, vahimilicha va vapuga, akanyilile kuhelela ku lila lipinga. Vanu va lipinga lila pevamwene mkomi yula na vapuga vake, vakaleka kumtova Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkomi va vapuga akamhelelie Paulo, akambatile na kuvaswitilicha avopwe ndegei cha kyuma. Baho akawucha, “Uyu munu liki na egita liki?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Vanu vamonga mulipinga lila vakali veywanga kinu iki na yungi kinu kila, yula mkomi va vapuga peawene kuva seiwesa kupatila undakyene lya luchowo kwakuva lya ndewo, yula mkomi va vapuga akaswitiliche Paulo asindikwe mu itwangilo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulo peafikile palikwelelo, vapuga vamunyamule kwakuva vanu vendelie kugita ndewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwakuva lipinga lya vanu likaendelie kubwatuka vakilonga, “Mumdoche uyo!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akwitasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Vapuga pevakali vakumwingicha mugati lya itwangilo, Paulo akamsukile mkomi va vapuga na akamlongie, “Ndiwesa kulonga kinu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Yula mkomi va vapuga akamhigile, “Wuli, wichela kuywanga Kigiliki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Wuli, veve se yula Mmisili ambaye ifi machuchi ukagitile uwofu na kuvalongocha vanu elufu chitai vevagehe na kyalukilo mbaka kukwelu?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo akavahigile, “Nene nde Myahudi, mbabwa va Taliso ukoya Kilikia mwani mkomi hilo. Ndisuka, mnileke ndeywange na vanu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Yula mkomi va vapuga akamlekile. Ndeni, Paulo emile pakwelelo, akahungie vanu kwa kupunga miwoko na pevayigale, akavangile kuywanga nawo kwa Kiebulania.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Paulo akalongie, “Lukolo vangu na daada vangu, mpulikiche pendikwitasa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Pevapulike akilonga kwa luga lya Kiebulania, vakachikile jii hilo. Paulo akaendelie kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Nene nde Myawudi, mubabwa va Taliso ku Kilikia. Ila ndaleliwe baha mu mwani va Yelusalemu ndikali mchulila va Gamalieli. Ndiwulanichwe kwa unofu kwibata malagicho gonda ambagyo Musa avagavie vagogolo vetu. Ndigangamalise kugita molofu kwa Nguluvi ngita nyenye pemugehe neng'uli. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Ndivagudisile na kuvadocha vanu yevafwatile ng'asi iyi. Ndikavapatile vagosi na vadala na kuvavika mukiwopo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mtekechi mkomi na ludamo lyonda lya vavaha vichela njowo icho. Ndikawanuke baluwa kuhuma kwavo kuvasindikila vala lukolo Vayawudi vevakali ukoya Damasiko, neke ndivabate vanu ava na ndivalete kuno vavopilwe mbaka Yelusalemu neke vatovwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo iganulila peawokwike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Magito 9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Pendikali mung'asi kuhelela Damasiko, ikali saa sita pamunyi, bahobaho welu mkomi kuhuma kuluhano ukanilangachila lubali chonda. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ndikague panyi, ndipulike lichwi yanilongie, Sauli, Sauli! Wuli ukuniguda? <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nene nikamuwucha, veve nde ani, Mtwa? Mwene akanihigile, nene nde Yesu va Nasaleti yeukuniguda. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Vala vayangu yendikali navo vakauwene welu, ila sevachelile lichwi lya yula yeakali elonga na nene. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Baho, nene ndikamuwucha, ndigite liki Mtwa? Mwene Mtwa akandilongie, wime na uhele ku mwani va Damasiko na ukoya dandikulongila fyonda fyeutakilwa kugita. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kuhumila na wula welu wung'alike sendawesile kulola ifyo ikavang'ang'ile vala vayangu kunilongocha kwa kunikolelie liwoko mbaka ku Damasiko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ukoya kukali na munu yumwi ekemeliwe Anania, munu yeakumfunya Nguluvi, mwene kuginya malagicho gyetu na yeaginyangwe hilo pautalo lya Vayawudi vonda vevakali vakwikala Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Mwene achile akaimile pepi na nene akalongie, lukolo lwangu Sauli, ulole kangi! Bahobaho ndalolile kangi. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Baho Anania akamlongie, Nguluvi va vagogolo vetu akuhague veve neke uchele lukelo lwake, umlole yula myigendwa vake mwidikila na kupulika luchowo lwake. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwakuva dawilonga njowo chake chonda kwa vanu vonda chila cheuchiwene na kuchipulika. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nondee suwe, wichindila liki? Wime, ubatiswe na kuhechelwa sambi chako kwa kudikila litawa lyake.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo elagichwa kuvadalikila vanu se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Pendawuyile ku Yelusalemu, pendikali ndifunya ku kaye lya Nguluvi, Nguluvi akaniwonesile kinu. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ndikamwene Mtwa Yesu akanilongie, ‘Kisatu! Uhege ku Yelusalemu, kwakuva vanu va baha sedavadikila kugalonga geukugalola kutigila nene.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nene ndikamhigile, ‘Mtwa, vavene vichela wachi kuva nene ndi yula yeakali echumba mukaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi neke kuvavika mukiwopo na kuvatova vala vevakwidikila. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Chipindi mswida vako Stefano peadochilwe, nene ndikali baha ndikidikila navo njowo icho na kugidima mikoti gya vala vevamdochile.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mwene Mtwa akandongie, ‘Uhelele, dandikulagicha uhelela kutali kwa vanu se Vayawudi.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Vala vanu vekali vakumpulikicha, ila pealongie njowo chila, vakavangile kubwatuka, “Mumdoche uyo! Munu ngita uyu seing'ang'wa kwikala.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Vendelie kubwatika na kutaga mikoti gyao kuno vakitaga lifuna kukyanya. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkomi va vapuga akavaswitilicha vanu vake vamsindike Paulo muitwangilo, akavalongie vamtove ndomondo neke vapate kuchela nogwa lya Vayawudi kumbwatukila. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ila pevasindile kumuwopa ndegei neke vamutove ndomondo, Paulo akamlongie mkomi va vapuga yumwi yeimile pepi, “Wuli nde unofu kwa nyenye kumtova ndomondo munu va Loma peakali ave seahigilwe?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yula mpuga peapulike njowo icho, akamhelelie mkomi va vapuga na kumlongela, “Wigita liki? Munu uyu ndi mwenekaye va ku Loma!” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yula mkomi va vapuga akamhelelie Paulo na kumuhucha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Ndongele, wuli, veve ndi mwenekaye va ku Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulo akamhigile, “Ena.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mkomi va vapuga akavalongie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">“Nene ndikali munu va Loma kwa kuhomba sendi cholofu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulo akamhigile, “Ila, nene ndi munu va ku Loma va kubabwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Vala vanu ambawo vevakali vemlolela kwapepi Paulo, vakahegile pono ilyo kisatu. Hata yula mkomi va vapuga akaogwipe hilo peachele kuva Paulo ndi mwenekaye va ku Loma na akali vamuwopile ndegei kya kyuma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akwitasa pautalo lya ludamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Pamilau lyake, mkomi va vapuga akang'ang'ile kuchela malato lyolyonda gyevamlatile Paulo. Ifyo akamuwopue Paulo, akavaswitiliche vakomi va vatekechi na ludamo lyonda vaywange. Baho akamletile Paulo, akamwimicha pautalo lya ludamo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo akavahulutulie meho vala valunasi va ludamo, akavalongie, “Lukololo lwangu, mbaka neng'uli ndikwendelela kugita manofu pautalo lya Nguluvi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Baho Anania mtekechi mkomi akavaswitiliche vala vevakali vemile pepi na Paulo vamtove limande kumlomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ila Paulo akavalongie, “Nguluvi yumwene akukutova veve yeukwigita mnofu ngita lukanji weubakilwe chokaa! Wiwesa wuli kwikala baho neke kunihiga kwa malagicho na kuno veve yumwene ukugadenya malagicho kwa kuswitilicha nditovwe?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Vanu vevakali vemile pala na Paulo vakamlongie, “Ukumliga mtekechi mkomi va Nguluvi!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo akahigile, “Lukolo vangu, sendachelile ngita mwene ndi mtekechi mkomi. Kwa kuva isimbilwe, ‘Ubihile kulonga liwofu kwa mtavala va vanu vako.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulo peachelile kuva lipinga limonga lya Masadukayo na vangi Mafalisayo akalongile kwa lichwi lyake kutalo lya ludamo, “Lukolo vangu, nene nde Mfalisayo, mwana va Mfalisayo. Nene ndiletilwe ku ludamo lya vahiga kwakuva ndihuvila kuva vanu vevafue davachulubuka.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Pealongile ago, malumbano weuhumie pagati lya Vafalisayo na Vasadukayo na ludamo likomi likagavanyike. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kwakuva Masadukayo vilonga kuva kwihela uchulubuko, vala kwihela ndumindumi lwa kuluhano kwa Nguluvi kwihela muhe. Ila Mafalisayo vakwidikila ifi fyonda fidatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Pakahumie na mabwatuko makomi, vamonga va vawulanichi va malagicho va lipinga lya Mafalisayo wakaimile na kulonga kwa lichwi, “Setuwene nogwa lyolyonda lyeagitile munu uyu, daivecha muhe awu ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi aywagile nave.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ndewo ukalutale kuva mkomi hilo hata mkomi va vapuga akawogwipe kuva davamdumula Paulo fipande fipande, akavaswitilicha lipinga lya vapuga vingie na kumhecha Paulo pagati lyawo na kumsindika muitwangilo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Pamie peufikile, Mtwa emile pepi na Paulo, akamlongie, “Uwime kwa ukakatima ngita peuvalongie njowo changu vanu va baha Yelusalemu, ndeni nde ying'ang'wa kuvalongie ukoya ku Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi ving'ang'a kumdocha Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Pekukie, Vayawudi vamonga vakagitile kikawo kya lupwepo. Vikilapiye “Setwilia vala kuywa mbaka petukumdocha Paulo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Vanu avo vevasakile kumdocha vakali vakaginile alobaini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Baho, vakahelele kwa valongochi va vatekechi na vagogolo vakalongie, “Nefwe twilapie kuwa setuliya kinu vala kuyuwa kyokyonda mbaka petukumdocha Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nondee, nyenye pamwi na ludamo mlagiche unanzi kwa mkomi va vapuga neke amlete Paulo kwa nyenye mwisingisie ngita mwikela kupatila unofu njowo chemchipulike. Nefwe tukumchindila mung'asi na kumdocha hata peave seafikile pepi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mpwa va Paulo peapulike kukyanya lya mpango ilyo liwofu, akahelele kula kuitwangilo na kumlongela Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Baho Paulo akamukemela yumwi va muhimilicha vavapuga akamlongie, “Msindike mdimi uyu kwa mkomi va vapuga, agehe na njowo lya kumlongela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yula muhimilicha va vapuga akamnyamue yula mdimi, akamsindike mbaka kwa mkomi va vapuga, akalongie, “Yula muwopwa Paulo anikemele na akunisuka ndimulete mdimi uyu kwa veve, mana agehe na njowo lwa kukulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkomi va vapuga akamkolela liwoko yula mdimi, akamsindike pono pa weka, akamuwuchile, “Wisaka kundilongela liki?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Mdimi akamhigile, “Vayawudi vapatine vakusuke, kilau umsindike Paulo kuludamo lyawo kwa vakwisingisila kuva vesaka kumlola hilo pakyanya nogwa lyake. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ila veve uvakanile kwakuva kuna vanu vaginile alobaini vipagile suwe kumfyamila neke kumdocha. Vilapile seviliya vala kuyuwa kinu mpaka pevakali vamdocha. Nondee vagehe suwe kumchindila hela ulamuchi vako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yula mkomi va vapuga akamlongie “Ubihile kumlongela munu yeyonda kuva anilongei njowo ichi.” Akamlekile yula mdimi ahelele.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo esindikwa kwa Mkomi va inyi Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Baho, mkomi va vapuga akavakemele vahimilicha vavili va vapuga akavalongie, “Muvike unofu vapuga mia chivili, vakang'ala falasi sabini na vapuga mya chivili va migoha, vahelele Kaisalia, mwitayalise saa chidatu pamie muve muhegile suwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kangi mwandalise falasi yeakugumbanikilwa na Paulo, mumsindike akiva unofu kwa Mkomi va inyi Felikisi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Pambele mkomi yula va vapuga akasimbile baluwa ifi.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Nene Kilawudia Lusia ndikuhungila, mtavala Felikisi Mkomi va inyi. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Munu uyu akaibatike na Vayawudi vasakile kumdoche, ila ndahele na lipinga lyangu lya vapuga ndikamwokuwe, kwakuva ndicheliswe kuva mwene ndi munu va inyi lya ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ndikamsindike pautalo lya lidamo lyao likomi ndakele kuchela lukani lwevakumlatia. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ndikawene vamlatile kwa nogwa lwa malagicho gyawo, ila sendawene nogwa lyolyonda lyelimgitile adochwe awu awopilwe mukiwopo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Pendicheliswe kuva Vayawudi vakali vagitile mpango lya kumdocha, ndiswitiliche kumsindika kwa veve. Kangi ndivalagiche valete malato gyawo kwa veve.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ifyo vapuga vamnyamuwe Paulo ngita pevalongilwe, vakamsindika pamie ulaula mbaka mwani va Anitipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Pamilau vala vapuga vevigenda kwa magulu vakawuyile kuitwangilo, vakavaleka vapuga vakang'ala falasi vahele pamwi na Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pevafikile ku Kaisalia vakamgavie baluwa yila yula Mkomi va inyi Felikisi, vakamkabisile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mkomi va inyi Felikisi peimbile balua akavawuchile, “Paulo ihumila kwiya?” Peacheliswe kuva ihumila inyi Kilikia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />akalongie, “Dandipulikicha nongwa lyako valata vako pevafika.” Baho akaswitilicha Paulo avikwe panyi lya vapuga mukaye lya ng'achale Helode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vakumlata Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Pefichumbile figono fihano Anania mtekechi mkomi, akafikile Kaisalia pamwi na vagogolo vamonga pamwi na munu yeakuvatanga vanu mumalato yeakemeliwe Tetulo. Vamuhelelie yula Mkomi va inyi Felikisi na kumlongela malato gyawo pakyanya ya Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulo akakemeliwe na Tetulo akavanga kumuhiga, akalonga ndeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Mkomi va inyi Felisi ulongochi vako mnofu uletile ulutengamaso kwa figono fyolofu kuutavala vako na makani golofu gyegasakilwe kugitwa muinyi lyetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Suwe, twianuka njowo ichi kwa lukeduko hilo na kuhecha luhongecho kwa veve pono poponda na kwa ng'asi lyolyonda yila. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ila bila kuyagicha muda vako, tukukusuka kwa usanzi vako, utupulikiche kwa udodo. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Twichela kuva munu uyu ndi msugu hilo. Mwene uvangicha ndewo kwa Vayawudi vonda mu inyi yonda na kilongochi va lipinga lya Vanasaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kangi akang'ang'ile kugita Kaye lya Nguluvi libihile kuvecha ngita Nguluvi peikela, nefwe tukamubatile. Twasakile kumuhiga kufwatila malagicho gyetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ila Lusia, mkomi va vapuga, achile na akamnyamula kwa ludali kuhuma mu mawoko getu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ngita ukimuhucha munu uyu, dawivesa kuchela njowo ichi chonda chetukumlata nefwe.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Vayawudi navo vakadikile gala malato, vakilonga, aga gonda gakali ndakyene.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akwitasa kwa Mkomi va inyi Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Baho, Mkomi va inyi Felikisi peamugololie kyala Paulo neke ayitase, Paulo akalongie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Ndikelie kwitasa pautalo lyako ndichela kuva veve ukali muhiga va inyi kwa myaka myolofu. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wiwesa kwihakikisila kuva sefichumbile figono kumi na fivili hela kuvangila pendihelele kufunya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Vayawudi sevaniwene ng'odo pendilumbana na munu yeyonda, Sevaniwene ndikivaswitilicha vanu ku kaye lya Nguluvi, hata mu kaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi awu pono pangi poponda mu mwani ugo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Vala seviwesa kwonesa malato gyao kuva gandakyene kwa nene. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ndikwidikila pautalo lyako kuva. Nene ndikumfunya Nguluvi va vagogolo vetu kwa kufatila ng'asi yila ambalyo vene vakuikemela kipinga kya vanu ndikwidikila fyonda fye fisimbilwe mu kiganilo kya Musa na vavichi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nene ndekumuhuvilila Nguluvi, ngita vawo pevakumuhuvilila, kuva vanu vasanzi na vanjanganifu, davichulubuka. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ifyo ndikangala figono fyonda kuva na numbula nofu pautalo lya Nguluvi na pautalo lya vanu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Badala lya kwikala kutali kwa myaka fidodo, ndikawuyile ku Yelusalemu neke kuvatanga vayangu na kuhumicha litambiko. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Vakaniwene mukaye lya Nguluvi pendikali ndigita njowo icho na vakaniwene nimalile suwe lufunyo lwa kyuwofoga. Sendikali na lipinga lya vanu vala sendagitile ndewo. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ila kukali na vamonga lya Vayawudi kuhuma ku Asia, avo ndi veng'ang'wa kuvecha baha pautalo lyangu na kuhumicha malato gyawo kwa nene. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Awu valeke ava vanu vevagehe baha valonge nongwa yevaiwene kwa nene pendimile pautalo lya ludamo likomi, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila ndikalongile njowo ichi pautalo lya vene, ‘Nene ndihigilwe kwakuva ndikwidila vanu vevafuwe davichulubuchwa!’” <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Baho, Mkomi va inyi Felisi ambaye mwene akali akuichela Ng'asi iyo unofu, akavalongie. “Ndihiga nongwa iyo chipindi Lusia, mkomi va vapuga peikwacha baha.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Baho akamswtiliche yula muhimilicha va vapuga amdime kwa unofu Paulo na kuvaleka vaganja vake vamtange kyekisaka.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akwitasa pautalo lya Mkomi va inyi Felikisi na Dulisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Pefichumbile figono fidodo, Mkomi Felikisi akafikile pamwi na mdala vake Dulisila, ambalye akali Myawudi. Akaswitilicha Paulo asindikwe, akampulikicha peilonga pakyanya lya kumwidikila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ila vakati Paulo peavangile kuywanga pakyanya lya unofu na pakyanya kuva fidodo na pakyanya lya kigono kya luhigo kyekikwacha, Felikisi akaogwipe na akalongie, “Leke tandi, ndikukemela kangi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Chipindi icho akali ihuvilila kuva Paulo akumgavila sendi, kwakuva amkemelie Paulo mala chonda na kuywanga nave.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Pegichumbile myaga givili kuchumba, Poliko Fesito akatolile fwasi lya Felikisi, ila kwakuva Felikisi akakelie kwiwonesa msanzi kwa Vayawudi, akamlekile Paulo mukiwopo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulo isuka akapulikichwe na Mkomi va ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Figono fidatu pefichumbile, Fesito akahumile ku Kaisalia na akahele ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ukoya vatekechi vakomi pamwi na vilongochi va Vayawudi vakaachile pautalo lya Fesito na kumlata Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Vakamsukile hilo Fesito, avagitile lusungu kwa kumsindika Paulo ku Yelusalemu kwakuva vakasakile kumfyamila na kumdocha mung'asi. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ila Fesito akahigile, “Paulo adimwa kwa unofu ukoya ku Kaisalia na nene ndihelela ukoya figono fidodo fyefikwacha. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Muvaleke filongochi venu vahelele ukoya ku Kaisalia pamwi na nene vakahumiche malato gyawo kukyanya lyake ngita agitile kyokyonda kiwofu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesito akwikala navo kwa figono finane awu kumi ifi, baho akawuyile kuhelela ku Kaisalia. Kilau lyake akahele mulidamo, akaswitiliche Paulo asindikwe mu ludamo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulo peafikile, vala Vayahudi vevachile kuhuma ku Yelusalemu vakamchungutile na vakavangile kuhumicha malato makomi ambagyo segigawanine. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulo akayitasile na kulonga, “Nene sendigitile nongwa lyolyonda kutigila malagicho gya Vayawudi, vala ku kaye lya Nguluvi, vala ku Kaisalia.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fesito akasakile kuvakelisa Vayawudi, ifyo akamuwucha Paulo, “Wuli, wikela kuhelela ku Yelusalemu na ukoya ukahigilwe pautalo lyangu kwa malato aga?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo akahigile, “Ndimile pautalo lya muhiga nongwa ambalye yeavikilwe na Kaisali mkomi va Loma, baha nding'ang'wa kuhigilwa. Ngita peuchela unofu, sendigitile uhofu wowonda kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ngita nene ndena malato lya kugita nongwa lyolyonda yenditakilwa kudochwa, sendikana kufua. Ila ngita kwihela undakyene pa malato yeyalongilwe na vanu ava, kwihela yeiwesa valongela vanigitile kyevisaka kunigita. Ndisuka mnisindike kwa mkomi va Loma akanihige!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Ila Fesito peasindile kuywanga na vanu va ludamo lyake lya kuhiga nongwa akamlongie Paulo, “Usukile uhelelekupulikichwa kwa mkomi va Loma, suwe, dawihela kwa mkomi va Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo pautalo lya Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Figono fidodo pambele, ng'achale Agilipi na Beliniki vakafikile Kaisali, neke vahumiche uginyange vawo kwa Fesito. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Na pevakali ukoya figono fyolofu, Fesito akamhumulila ng'achale njowo cha Paulo akalongie, baha kuna munu yumwi ambalye Felikisi akamlekile adimwe kwa unofu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Pendihelele ku Yelusalemu vakomi va vatekechi na vavaha va Vayawudi vakanilongie njowo chake na vakanisukile ndimuhige nongwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ndikavahigile kuva se machovelelo gya Valoma kumuhecha munu yeyonda ahigilwe kabula lya kutang'ana na valatwa vawo na kugavilwa fwasi lwa kwitasa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ifyo vonda pevatang'ane baha sendichelewile kigono kye kyachile ndikahigile nongwa, ndikalagiliche munu uyo aletwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Na vala vevamlatile pevimile sevalongile luchowo lyolyonda liwofu ngita pendihochile, <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ila vakali na malumbano myolofu cha dini chawo hela na njowo cha munu yumwi yeafuwe yeikemelwa Yesu ila Paulo akali akilonga kuva munu uyo agehe wumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kwakuva sendichelege lya kugita kutigila malato ago. Ila ndikamuwucha Paulo ngita ukela kuhelela ku Yelusalemu na kuhigwa malata ago. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ila Paulo akasakile akapulikichwe na ng'achale mkomi va ku Loma, ifyo ndikalagiliche vamdime kwa unofu mbaka pendikumsindika kwa ng'achale mkomi va ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipi akamulongie Fesito, ndikela kumpulikicha munu uyu, Fesito akamlongie, “Dampulikicha kilau.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo pautalo lya Agilipi na Belinike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Pamilau lyake, Agilipi na Beliniki vakafikile kwa lukeduko mkomi muludamo vakiva vilongochine na vakomi va vapuga na vilongochi va mwani. Fesito akaswitiliche Paulo aletilwe mugati lwa ludamo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesito akalongie, “Ng'achale Agilipi na vanu vonda vemugehe baha, mukumlola munu uyu? Vayawudi vonda va ukoya ku Yelusalemu na vevali baha Kaisalia vakanisukile ndimuhumiche munu uyu adochwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ila nene sendiwene kuva seagitile luchowo lwa kung'ang'ilwa kudochwa. Ila Paulo yumwene akasukile akapulikichwe na ng'achale mkomi va Loma ndikaswitiliche kumsindika ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ila nene ndihela luchowo kwa mwene ambalyo lya ngandisimbe kwa ng'achale mkomi va Kaisali. Ifyo ndimletile baha pautalo lyenu na pautalo lyako veve ng'achale Agilipi pemsinda kumuhucha ndipate kinu kya kusimba. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwakuva ndilola seunofu kumsindika msutu kwa ng'achale va Loma, bila kuwonesa malatwa gyake.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulo akwitasa pautalo lya Agilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipi akamlongie Paulo, “Ugavilwe fwasi lwa kwitasa.” Baho Paulo akagololise liwoko neke vachike na akavangile kwitasa endee, <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Ng'achale Agilipi, ndikwiwona ngiba kwima pautalo lyako, pendikwitasa kulonga malata gyonda ambagyo Vayawudi vakandogilege. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kwakuva veve uchela unofu machovelo chonda cha Vayawudi na malumbano gyao gyonda. Ifyo ndisuka unipulikiche kwa ufumilifu.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Vayawudi vonda vakuchela njowo changu kuhuma pauwana vangu, namuna pendikalile kuhuma kutali mu inyi lyangu na ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Vakunichela kuhuma pamwandi na viwesa kulonga undakyene ngita vikela, ndikali munu yendidikiye hilo dini lya Vafalisayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nondee, ndihigwa neng'uli, kwakuva ndikuhuvilila kila kyealongile Nguluvi kwa daada vetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ilyo ndi kyealongile Nguluvi, ndikila kyekihuvililwa na makabila kumi na gavili va inyi lyetu kwa fipindi fyonda pamunyi na pamie. Mkomi ng'achale, Vayawudi vakunilata kwakuva lya luhuvilila ilyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kwa liki nyenye mwiwona kuva Nguluvi sedaiwesa kuvachulubucha vanu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Ndakyene nene yune ndikadikie kuva nding'ang'wa kugita makani myolofu kulipinja litawa lya Yesu va Nasaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Makani ago ndigo ndikagagitile ukoya ku Yelusalemu. Nene yune, ndikiva ndigavilwe umwimike kuhuma kwa vatekechi vakomi, ndikavavikile mukiwopo vanu wolofu va Nguluvi. Nawo pevahigilwe kudochwa na ndikadikile vadochwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mala chongofu ndikavaswitilichwe vatovwe mukaye lya kufunyila Vayawudi chechigehe pono chingi, ndikivaswitilicha vaileme mbatwa lyawo. Luvipo lyangu kwavene ikali ngomi, hata ndikavasakile mbaka mumwani cha uhenja.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ihumulila peamdikie Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Magito 9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Kigono kimwi ndikang'ang'we kuhelela ku Damasiko kuno ndikiva ndigavilwe umwimike na malagilicho kuhuma kwa vatekechi vakomi. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Veve mutwa, pendigehe mung'asi saa sita pamunyi, ndikawene welu mkomi kuchumba va lichuwa ukilangacha kuhuma kuluhano, ukanichungutile nene na vala veyangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Nefwe vonda tukague panyi, nene ndikapulike lichwi yandongele kwa luga kya Kibulaniya, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Wuli ukuniguda? Ukwilemecha hela ngita senga yeitova kwa ligulu lubiki lwa mtwa vake.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Nene ndikahuchile, ‘Nde ani veve Mtwa?’ Mwene akanihigile, ‘Nene ndi Yesu ambaye ukunigudicha, <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nondee wime, ndikuhumie neke ndikuvike uveche mnyigendwa vangu. Dauvecha ukivalongela vanu njowo cheuchilolile neng'uli na chila ambacho chave, dandikuwonesa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Dandikudima na vanu va Isilaeli na vanu se Vayawudi vangi, ambawo nene ndikulagilicha kwa vene. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Dakuvagubutula meho gyawo na kuvawesesa vahume mukisi na kwingila muwelu, vahege mu utavala va Setani na kumgumbanikila Nguluvi. Kwa kudikila davavesa kuhechelwa sambi chawo na kutegula pono pawo pagati lya vala yevamdikie.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ihumulila kasi lyake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Ifyo, ng'achale Agilipi sendikavesile kugadikila gala Nguluvi gyeandiwonise. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ila ndikavangile kulanducha tandi kwa vanu va ku Damasiko, kangi kwa vala vanu vevakali ku Yelusalemu na inyi yonda lya Yuda na kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Ndikavaswitiliche vamsedukile Nguluvi na kuwonesa wachi wachi kwa kugagita gala gyeakugakela Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwa kugagita ago, Vayawudi vakanibatile pendikali ku kaye lya Nguluvi, vakagechile kunidocha. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ila Nguluvi akanitangile, mbaka kigono kya neng'uli ndimile baha, ndikilonga gala gyonda gendigalole, vakomi na vadodo. Gendilonga gala ambagyo vavichi va Nguluvi na Musa vakalongile dagihuma, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuva ikamng'ang'ise Kilisito agudwe na kuva va kwanja kuchulubuka, neke alanduche kuva welu va ukombosi ukuvang'alicha nondee vanu vonda, Vayawudi na vala se Vayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulo peafikile baha kwitasa, Fesito akabwatile, “Paulo! Una, lukwale! Kukwimba kwa figono fyolofu, ikugitile uveche na lukwale!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ila Paulo akahigile, “Nene, ndihela lukwale mkomi Fesito. Kyendikulongela ndi undakyene. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Veve ng'achale Agilipi ukugachela makani ichi, kwa ifyo ndiwesa kuywanga bila wogofi pautalo lyako. Ndihela masaka kuva makani ago gichelwa kwa veve kwakuva lukani ulu selikagitilwe mufyama. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ng'achale Agilipi, ukuvaidikila vavichi va Nguluvi? Ndichela kuva ukuvaidikila.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipi akamhigile Paulo, kwa chipindi ichi chidodo dawivesa kunigita ndi mdikie Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo akamhigile, “Ndikumlumba Nguluvi kuva, iveche kwa chipindi chidodo awu chitali, se veve hela bali vonda vevakunipulikicha neng'uli vawese kuva ngita nene, ila se na ichi mindegei gya kyuma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Baho ng'achale Agilipi, mkomi va mwani na Beliniki na vala vevakali pamwi navo, vonda vakakwimile. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pevahegile, vakalonganile, “Munu uyu seagitile kyokyonda kye kumgita kudochwa awu kuwopwa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Nave Agilipi akamlongie Fesito, “Munu uyu ngavamlekile ngita sengaasukile kuhelela kuhigwa kwa Kaisali ng'achale mkomi va Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulo isindikwa kwa ng'achale mkomi va ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Pevalamuwe kuhega mbaka ku Italia, vamvikile Paulo pamwi na vasutu vangi panyi lya udima lwa Yulio yeakali mkomi va lipinga lya vapuga kyekikemeliwe, “Kipinga kya Kaisali Agusitino.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tukakang'alie kinu kikomi kyamumalenga kekikemelwa meli yeihumile Adilamito yeikali mulugendo ikali ichumbila pono pakuimilicha meli mu inyi cha Asia, tukavangile lugendo. Alisitaliko mwenekaye va mwani va Tesolonike veugehe inyi lya Mekidoniya akali mu meli pamwi na nefwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Pamilau lyake, twimile pono lya kukwimilicha meli ku Sidoni. Yulio akamgitie Paulo manofu kwa kumuleke atang'ane na vaganja vake na kupata finu fyeikela. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kuhuma ukoya tukaendelile na lugendo, ila kwakuva lukala ukali upuga hilo kuhumila kutalo, tukachumbile lubali lwa ligunguli kya Kupilo ambako lukala seukali wolofu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Pambele tukahagime mu inyanza yeigehe palubali lya Kilikilia na Pamfulia, tukakwimile ku Mula, mwani va Lukia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ukoya yula mkomi va vapuga akawene meli imwi yeihumile mu mwani va Alekesandia yeikali ihelela ku inyi lya Italia na akatukang'iche mumeli igo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kwa figono fyolofu tukagendelile molemole kwa magudo tukafikile pepi na Nido. Kwakuva lukala ukali vave ukutupinja, tukaendeliye kuutalo kuchumbila lubali lwa ku Kilete pepi na Salimoni ambako lukala seukali wolofu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tukachumbile palubali lwake kwa magudo tukafikile pono peikemelwa “Pono nofu lya kwimilicha meli,” Pepi na mwani va Lesea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Tukali tugendile kwa figono fyolofu lihungu lya kwikala bila kuliya ikali ichumbile. Kwakuva pefichumba figono fya kwikala bila kuliya inyanza itimbwike ifyo se unofu kwendelela na lugendo. Paulo akavalongela, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Vagosi, ndilola kuva lugendo ulu daivecha se nofu na misigo dachiyaganika se pamwi na meli hela, ila na uwumi vetu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ila yula mkomi va vapuga akakwegilwe hilo gealongile na mguba meli na mwene meli kuchumba gala gyealongile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwakuva pono pa kwimichila meli sepakali panofu kwikala chipindi cha ng'ala, vanu vangi vakakeliye kwendelela na lugendo, ngita ikiwesekana vafike ku Foinikia. Foinikia ikali pono pa kwimichila meli, mukigunguli kya Kilete kyekikali palubali lwa kwivindi pelidibala lichuwa na kukyanya pelidibala lichuwa na ukoya viwesa kwikala chipindi cha ng'ala.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukala likomi mu inyanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Suwe, lukala weuchikile peuvangile kupuga kuhuma palubali lwa kwivindi, vakachele kuva viwesa kuhega, vakavanga lugendo kuchumbila ng'umbung'umbu lya kigunguli lya Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ila seichumbile muda, lukala likomi weukemelwa, “Lukala lwa kuhumila palubali lwa kukyanya” Ukavangile kupuga kuhumila ku kigunguli. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Lukala mkomi ukautovile paubali lya meli na setuwesile kuguba, tukaulekile usung'we na lukala. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Tukachumbile mu kigunguli kidodo weugehe palubali lwa kwivindi, kyekikemelwa Kauda, tukawesile kuchumba ila kwa magudo tukawesile kuukwega wula meli weugehe mumeli mkomi kwa kuvawokolea vanu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Vala vaguba vakaukwegile wato mugati, baho vakawopile kwa ndegei panyi lya meli. Vakaogwipe kugomela mung'umbung'umbu lwa inyanza, kigunguli kya Libiya. Kwa ifyo, vakakwisile kinu kisito neke kutanga meli igende molemole na kuleka wula meli usung'we na lukala. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Lukala ukaendeliye kupuga na pamilau lyake vakavanga kutaga misigo gyegikali mu meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Kigono kya Udatu, vakavangile kangi kutaga mu malenga finu fya mumeli kwa mawoko gyawo vavene. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa figono fyolofu setuwesile kulola lichuwa vala nondwa, lukala uendeliye kupuga hilo, hata tukawene setuwesa kunana kangi.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Petukalile kwa muda wolofu bila kuliya kinu, Paulo akakwimile pagati lyawo akavalongie, “Vagosi, ikavang'ang'ile ngamkunipulikicha na kuleka lugendo kuhuma Kilete. Semungewesile kupata magudo igi na kupata asala ichi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ila nondee ndikuvasuka mbihile kogopa, kwihela hata yumwi venu yeiyagicha uwumi vake ila meli weka hela daidibala. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Nene ndi munu va Nguluvi, kangi ndi mnyigendwa vake, neng'uli pamie ndumindumi vake akanihumie, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />akanilongie, Paulo bihile kogopa! Ndi ung'ang'ilwa wime pautalo lwa ng'achale mkomi va Loma. Kangi uchele kuva vonda veugenda navo, Nguluvi dakuvawokola kwa usanzi vake. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ifyo, vagosi mwikangiche! Kwakuva ndikumdikila Nguluvi kuva daiwesa ngita peandongilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ila datugomela mung'umbung'umbu mwa kigunguli kingi.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Pamie va kigono kya chumi na utai, tukali tukwegwa na lukala kuno na kuno mu inyanza lya Adilia. Pepi na mwilogoti vaguba vakahochile kuva pepi na inyi ng'afu Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ifyo vakasakile utali va inyanza kwa kukwisa ndegei yeikali ihopilwe kinu kisito, vakapitile utali va mita alobaini. Pambele vakapimile kangi vapatile mita selasini. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwa kukogofya kugoma mu liganga likomi, vakahopile finu fisito fitai kumbele lya meli na vakasukile kutandamuke kisatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Vaguba vasakile kutolwika na vakakwisile wato mdodo mumalenga va kuwokolela vanu, vakayigita kuva vihela kukwisa finu fisito fya kwimicha meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ila Paulo akamlongie mkomi va vapuga na vapuga vake, “Ngita vaguba meli ava sevasigala mumeli, sedamuwokoliwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Baho vala vapuga vakachidumule ndegei chechikali chiwopile wula wato mdodo, vakauleka uhele na malenga.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Pepi na kinyola sagala, Paulo akavalongie vanu vonda valie kyakula, akilonga, “Neng'uli ndi kigono kya kumi na utai mugehe na wogofi na semuliye kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Suwe, ndikuvasuka muliye kyakulia, neke muwese kwikala. Kwakuva kwihela daefua vala kulemachwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Peasindile kulonga ago, Paulo akanyamule libumunda, akamlumba Nguluvi pautalo lyawo, akaudumule, akavanga kulia. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Baho vonda vakapatile ludali na kila yumwi akavangile kulia. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Vanu vevagehe mumeli vakali miya chivili na sabini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Pevaliye na kuguta, vakapwemuse usito va meli kwa kutaga mabebelo mu inyanza.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meli gwidenyeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Pekukie, vaguba sevawesile kuichela inyi yila, ila vakawene kigunguli kimwi kya muhanga, vakahochile kusindika meli ukoya ngita iwesekana. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ifyo vakadumule ndegei chechihopile finu fisito na kufilekela mu inyanza, vakadinduwe ndegei chechihopile pondo. Baho vakadinduwe mgololo neke lukala usung'e meli kwelela kukigunguli. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ila pevakafikile pono lya kukimelo cha inyanza, meli ukagomie. Pono lya kuutalo ikali idibale mumuhanga bila kuhongoseka. Pono lya kumbele lya meli ikavangile kudenyeka fipande fipande kwa kutovwa na madaba genye ludali.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Vapuga vakasakile kuvadocha vasutu vonda kwa kuwogwipa kuva vangesugila mbaka kukigunguli na kutolwika. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ila kwa fila yula mkomi va vapuga akasakile kumuwokola Paulo, ifyo akavakanile vapuga vake vabihile kugita ndeni. Akaswitiliche vala vapuga vevichela kusugila vadaluke kuhuma mumeli na kusugila mbaka mung'umbung'umbu lya kigunguli, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na vangi veseviwesa kusugila mung'umbung'umbu lya lihiva na vanyamule mbawo awu ipande fya meli fyefidenyike. Ndeni, vonda tukachabuke tukiva wumi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kukigunguli kya Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Petufikile ku inyi ng'afu, tukachela kuva kigunguli kila kikemelwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Venekaye va kigunguli kila vakali vasanzi hilo kwa nefwe. Ndonya ikali ivangile kutonya na kukali na ng'ala, ifyo vakakochile lyoto, vakatuwanuke. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo akaholile msigo mdodo va sagala akafungachila mulyoto. Liyoka akahumile mulyoto kwakuva lya lyoto mwene sumu akamnyengelela muliwoko lya Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Vala venekaye va kila kigunguli pevawene yula liyoka akwinumbisa mumuwoko va Paulo vakamlongie, “Munu uyu mdochaji, hata ngita aokwike kufua mu inyanza, suwe, nguluvi akumuhomba kwa mawofu gyake!” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ila Paulo akampumunile mu lyoto yula liyoka na seamlamiche hata kidodo. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Vala vanu vakali vihocha kuva daatupe awu aguwe panyi na kufua. Ila pevachindile kwa chipindi cholofu na pevawonile kwihela kinu kinjanganifu kyekimuhumie, vakaseduche mahocho gyawo vakalongie kuva Paulo ndi yimwi va valungulu.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Pepi na pono yila, pakali na mgunda mkomi va munu yumwi mkomi va kigunguli kila, yeakemeliwe Pubilio, akatuwanuke na kutukumbanikila kwa usanzi mkomi kwa figono fidatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Daada vake Pubilio akali avasile paulili, akiva itamika uvauwa na kuhalisa danda. Paulo akaingile mugati neke amlole na pevamalile kumlumba Nguluvi, akavikile mawoko pakyanya lyake na akananichwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Luchowo lula pelihumile, vanu vonda va kigunguli kila vevakali vatamwa vachile, navo vakananichwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Vanu vakatugavila fupo chogofu na chipindi petuvangile lugendo kangi, vakavikile mumeli kila kinu kyekisakile mulugendo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ifika ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Pegichumbile myechi midatu tukavangile lugendo kwa meli wehumile ku Alekesandia yeukemelwa, “Valungulu pacha”. Meli ugo ukahimilichwe baha Malita kwa chipindi chonda cha ng'ala. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Kuhuma ukoya tukafikile ku mwani va Silakusa, tukakalie baho kwa figono fidatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Baho tukahumile baho tukafikile mu mwani lwa Legio. Kigono kyekifikile lukala lukomi ukapugile kuhuma palubali lya kwivindi na pefichumbile figono fivili tukafikile Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ukoya tukawawene vanu vevamdikie Yesu, vakatusukile twikalile navo kwa figono saba. Baho tukaendeliye na lugendo mbaka Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Vanu vevamdikie Yesu va ukoya ku Loma pevapulike luchowo lwetu, vachile mbaka ku soko lya Apio na Kaye chidatu chakwikala vagenji. Paulo peawawene, akamuhongecha Nguluvi, akakedukile hilo munumbula lyake.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ukoya Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Petufikile Loma, Paulo aswitilichwe kwikala wekahela akiva na mpuga yumwi va kumdima.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Kigono kya udatu Paulo akavakemela vilongochi va Vayawudi pamwi va pono pala. Pevakung'ese akavalongie, “Vayawudi vayangu, ingava sendigitile kyokyonda kinjanganifu kwa vanu vetu vala kupinja njowo chechituchovile kuhuma kwa vagogolo vetu, ndibatilwe ukoya ku Yelusalemu na kusindikwa kwa vilongochi va Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Pevanihuchile na kulola kuva ndihela na malato gyogyonda, vakasakile kunileka. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ila Vayawudi vangi vakalipinjile luchowo ulo na nene ndikasikale kuhelela kuhigwa nongwa kwa ng'achale mkomi va Loma, ingava sendikali na kyokyonda kya kuvalata Vayawudi vayangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Kwakuva ndikasukile kutang'anila na nyenye na kuywanga na nyenye, kwakuva ndiwopilwe ndegei cha kyuma igi kwakuva lya uhuvililo lila lyeichindilwa na vanu va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Vonda vakalongie, “Nefwe setuwanuke baluwa yoyonda kuhuma ku Yudeya, vala kwihela munu yeyonda yeahumile ukoya na kutulongela njowo chako njanganifu. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ila twisaka tukupulike veve mweme wilonga liki, kwakuva twichela kuva kila pono twipulika vanu vilonga njowo njanganifu kutigila lipinga ilyi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ifyo vakalonganile kigono kya kutang'ana na Paulo, na vanu volofu vakafikile pekwikala Paulo. Kuhuma pamilau mbaka pamie Paulo avalongie na kuvaganulila kukyanya lya Ung'achale va Nguluvi na kwa malagilicho gya Musa na masimbo gya vavichi va Nguluvi, akigecha kuvagita vamdikie Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Vamonga vawo vakadikila njowo chake, ila vangi sevamwidikie. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ifyo kukali na malimbano vene kwa vene na vakavanga kuhega, Paulo akalonga lukani ulu, “Muhe va Nguluvi akavalongie undakyene vagogolo venu kuchumbila mvichi va Nguluvi Isaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />akilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Hele kwa vanu ava, ukavalongie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kupulika damwipulika, ila sedamwichela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kulola damwilola, ila sedamwilola kinu.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kwakuva luhala lyawo chipugile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">masigicha gyawo gidindile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">meho gyawo gidindile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">vangelolile kwa meho gyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kupulika kwa masigicha gyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kuchela kwa luhala lwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kuchileka njowo chawo njanganifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">neke ndivananiche.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Baho Paulo akamalile kwa kulonga, “Ndisaka mchele kuva lunjowo lwa ukombosi va Nguluvi usindikwe kwa vanu se Vayawudi, navo davaupulikicha!”<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paulo peamalile kulonga ago, Vayawudi vakahegile kuno vakiva vakwihucha njowo chongofu. <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa chipindi cha myaka givili gyonda Paulo akakalile mu kaye lyakuhomba sendi, akiva akuvawanuka vonda vevafikile kumuhungila. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Akali akudalika Ung'achale va Nguluvi na kuwulanicha kukyanya lya Mtwa Yesu Kilisito kwa ukakatima na kwihela munu yeamkanile.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>